# game/12 - Talks.rpy:4
translate chinese moxtalkm_4e3b4720:

    # mc "So, you’ve been here for quite a while, huh? A lot longer than the other [mox]."
    mc "所以，你已经来了有一段时间了是吗，比其他马早了很久"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:5
translate chinese moxtalkm_ede971e9:

    # mox "Yeah, for a few years now."
    mox "是啊，有几年了"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:6
translate chinese moxtalkm_d3b8ea7a:

    # mc "What’s your favourite thing about this city? I feel like I’m still trying to figure out where everything is."
    mc "你最喜欢这个城市的那一部分啊？我还没摸清哪是哪呢"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:8
translate chinese moxtalkm_4e61c1d3:

    # mox "Favourite thing? That’s easy! It’s the energy."
    mox "最喜欢的？简单！是这个城市的活力感"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:9
translate chinese moxtalkm_706e0b71:

    # mox "Despite everything, the city still finds a way to hum, you know?"
    mox "不管发生什么事，这个城市照样嗡嗡转，懂？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:10
translate chinese moxtalkm_77b5e723:

    # mox "There’s always something happening – a festival, a brawl, a scandal. You can feel the escapism in the air."
    mox "总是有事情在发生，庆典啦，斗殴啦，丑闻啦，你可以感受到空气中的遁世感"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:11
translate chinese moxtalkm_e1db32a9:

    # mc "I was going to say that sounds exciting, but… brawls and scandals?"
    mc "我本来想说听起来很不错啊，但是...斗殴和丑闻是怎么回事？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:13
translate chinese moxtalkm_f0514cc6:

    # mox "Heh, the chaos can keep things interesting. You’ll see – it grows on you."
    mox "嘿,无序可以让事情变得有趣。过些日子你会喜欢上的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:14
translate chinese moxtalkm_86876e0e:

    # mox "Just don’t get caught up in the wrong kind of trouble. Unless it’s fun trouble; then I say go for it~"
    mox "只要别惹上不该惹的麻烦，除非很有意思，那样的话我建议试一下"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:16
translate chinese moxtalkm_7dd063bf:

    # mc "Believe it or not, but ‘magic shows’ were real in my human world too."
    mc "爱信不信，但是魔法表演在我们人类世界也是存在的"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:17
translate chinese moxtalkm_b4c76e55:

    # mc "Can you tell me more about your shows. It must be hard keeping them interesting when... magic is real… right?"
    mc "你能详细说说你的表演吗，在魔法真实存在的情况下...让表演有趣肯定是个难事,,,对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:19
translate chinese moxtalkm_2a4d9fff:

    # mox "Haha, that’s a good question, but magic has its limitations. An alicorn could show me up with traditional magic, but I need to do a mixture to pull off my tricks!"
    mox "哈哈，好问题，但魔法也有它的局限性，角马也许在传统魔法上胜我一筹，但我将戏法与魔法混合使用来让我的表演更加精彩"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:20
translate chinese moxtalkm_d8c9a4bb:

    # mox "A little sleight of hand, some illusion work, and just a touch of real magic to make the audience wonder. They eat it up!"
    mox "一点精妙的手法，一些幻术，再点上一些真正的魔法让观众深陷其中，他们很喜欢的！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:21
translate chinese moxtalkm_39e0b3a6:

    # mox "Magical performances have always been about doing the impossible, even in a world where magic exists."
    mox "魔术表演一直在做不可能的事，即使在魔法存在的世界。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:22
translate chinese moxtalkm_970dcbcc:

    # mc "Do you have an example? Maybe a signature trick?"
    mc "举个例子？比如招牌技？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:24
translate chinese moxtalkm_8cdfe268:

    # mox "Hmm, I shouldn’t really be explaining it, but I can make an exception for you~"
    mox "emm，我不应该透露的，但我可以为你破个例~"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:25
translate chinese moxtalkm_59a4c233:

    # mox "I like to start a lot of my performances with a vanishing act. I use real magic to create a sudden smoke screen. Then, in a burst of light, I appear somewhere else."
    mox "我喜欢以消失表演作为开场，先用真正的魔法架起烟幕，然后在灯光四射中，我在某处闪亮登场"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:26
translate chinese moxtalkm_88de6b31:

    # mox "Basically, I’m pretending to teleport."
    mox "简单来说，我会假装瞬移"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:27
translate chinese moxtalkm_eac7856d:

    # mox "But the real trick is that the first [mox] that steps onto stage isn’t me. It’s someone using magic to disguise themselves as me."
    mox "但是真正的技法是站在舞台上的第一个小马[mox]不是我，是别的小马用魔法伪装成我"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:28
translate chinese moxtalkm_677014ef:

    # mc "W-Wha--?! I wouldn’t have guessed that!"
    mc "啊-啊？我根本没猜到！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:30
translate chinese moxtalkm_47cd6bee:

    # mox "Are you starting to see how magic shows can still be fun in a world of magic? Hehe."
    mox "你开始觉得魔术表演在魔法世界仍然有趣了吗？哈哈"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:33
translate chinese moxtalkm_9a0ffc08:

    # mox "Ever since I laid eyes on you, you’ve been quite a tough one to pin down."
    mox "从遇见你开始，你一直是个难以捉摸的人"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:34
translate chinese moxtalkm_b2156e58:

    # mox "I admit, I may have moved too fast with you, and I’ve been leaning on you a lot for my own needs."
    mox "我得承认，我也许和你进展有些太快了，而且我还经常因为各种原因依赖着你。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:35
translate chinese moxtalkm_4c89b943:

    # mox "But I don’t regret it. Sometimes rules are made to be broken. You’re the missing puzzle piece I needed in my life. I’m mid-twenties, too exhausted to date, schedule filled with work…"
    mox "但我从不后悔。有时候规矩就是用来打破的，你就是我生活中缺失的那一块不可或缺的拼图。我现在二十多岁，生活中永远满是工作，总是被生活所压倒，累得连约会都没精神了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:36
translate chinese moxtalkm_27e93fa9:

    # mox "Then a sexy man just walks into my life. He’s a great guy and washes the dishes without being asked."
    mox "然后一位充满魅力的性感男士闯入了我的生活，甚至在我还没问的情况下就去把盘子洗了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:37
translate chinese moxtalkm_95f91054:

    # mc "Hey, that’s the bare minimum."
    mc "嘿，至少也得做到这一点吧！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:39
translate chinese moxtalkm_35ade3fb:

    # mox "What, being sexy?!"
    mox "等等，你说性感？！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:41
translate chinese moxtalkm_1b260cfb:

    # mox "Are all humans hot?"
    mox "所有的人类都很性感吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:42
translate chinese moxtalkm_ea7bf95e:

    # mc "The only reason my body is this toned is because your society is naked. I’ve been working out and exercising to reach this standard since I first arrived in the other Arcadia."
    mc "我身材这么好的唯一原因就是你们社会的每一个人都裸着。而且为了达到这个身材，我自从到了另一个Arcadia的那一天起就一直在健身。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:43
translate chinese moxtalkm_58ded150:

    # mc "Helps that your food is extremely nutritious."
    mc "加之你的食物特别有营养。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:45
translate chinese moxtalkm_f455a41e:

    # mox "You’re still going to be freezing by the time winter rolls over, but…"
    mox "你到了冬天还是会冻得够呛，不过......"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:46
translate chinese moxtalkm_64f214a2:

    # mox "You’re one of us."
    mox "你是我们中的一份子。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:47
translate chinese moxtalkm_8010adcb:

    # mox "If anyone gives you a hard time, just point them my way. I’ll set ‘em straight!"
    mox "如果谁惹毛你，告诉我他们在哪，我来给他们点颜色瞧瞧！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:48
translate chinese moxtalkm_4c85e077:

    # mc "Don’t worry, I’ll be the one giving people hard times."
    mc "别担心，我也能成为那只找麻烦的马。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:50
translate chinese moxtalkm_708a4c83:

    # mox "Ooooo, cheeky~!"
    mox "嘻嘻，挺调皮的吧~"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:52
translate chinese moxtalkm_b2c23766:

    # mc "What’s the local buzz around the city lately?"
    mc "最近城市附近有什么小道消息？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:54
translate chinese moxtalkm_3a6193a5:

    # mox "I do hear some interesting stories in my position, but my ears are usually tuned to ‘short-term memory’ during gossip."
    mox "我这个职业确实能听到一些有意思的故事，不过听这些杂谈的时候我就左耳进右耳出了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:55
translate chinese moxtalkm_e050b930:

    # mox "Truth is, there’s always something going on in the city, and that makes it feel like nothing is going on. Know what I mean?"
    mox "事实是，总有新事物在城市上演，每天都有新事物，就像每天都没什么大事一样，懂我意思吧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:56
translate chinese moxtalkm_ca508331:

    # mox "The city’s like a beehive – busy, buzzing, and sometimes someone gets stung."
    mox "这座城市就像蜂巢一样——匆匆忙忙，吵吵闹闹，有时候还会被别人“蛰”一下。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:57
translate chinese moxtalkm_8f59f402:

    # mc "Anyone getting stung at the moment?"
    mc "最近有人被“蛰”了吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:59
translate chinese moxtalkm_10f6f4dc:

    # mox "Freed up from other obligations, the guards have been cracking down harder on smuggling lately. Some say it’s because there’s been a spike of dark relics showing up in the markets."
    mox "卫兵们把之前的活都干完了，最近在大力打击走私，有些马说是因为最近市场上突然出现了大量暗黑遗物。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:61
translate chinese moxtalkm_e3a4698b:

    # mc "Guess that’s because the darkness was recently lifted, and looters are taking advantage?"
    mc "我猜是因为最近黑暗的增多，而那些劫掠者趁火打劫了一些。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:62
translate chinese moxtalkm_e98582ce:

    # mox "Exactly~"
    mox "就是这样~"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:64
translate chinese moxtalkm_273b745c:

    # mc "Related to the darkness?"
    mc "和黑暗有关？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:65
translate chinese moxtalkm_2c52bd93:

    # mox "Yeah, nasty stuff. Rings and weapons found within or near it. A few too many people going missing in the black district if you catch my drift."
    mox "嗯，那些恶心的东西，那附近发现了戒指和武器，最近黑区失踪的马有些太多了，如果你懂我意思的话。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:66
translate chinese moxtalkm_3726762f:

    # mc "How could anyone possibly benefit from that?"
    mc "怎么会有马想着发这种财？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:67
translate chinese moxtalkm_18e99141:

    # mox "There are a few independent factions that are always trying to one-up each other. But you’ve seen the guards posted all around the city, right? They’re not for show."
    mox "是有那么几个独立的小团体在互相争斗，但你也看到过城市里遍布的卫队吧，他们又不是摆设。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:68
translate chinese moxtalkm_b6d1f57c:

    # mox "The city’s always been very militant, especially recently with tightening patrols and non-stop recruitment."
    mox "这座城市总是非常军事化，尤其是最近巡逻加强，还不停在招募新马入伍。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:71
translate chinese moxtalkm_3b51b516:

    # mox "Of course, we know why now, [aur] was preparing to fight Midnight. But at the time, there were endless rumours."
    mox "当然，我们也知道为什么会这样，[aur]正在准备与Midnight的战争，但如今，社会上流传着无数的传言。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:72
translate chinese moxtalkm_a0dbcc03:

    # mox "I think things will calm down now. Time for an era of peace. There will just be a little more cleanup before we finally get there, and I’m happy to play my part in that as a virtue."
    mox "我想所有事情总有一天会重归平静。随之而来的便是和平时代，即使我们还得再做一些收尾工作才能达到这一理想，我也很乐意作为谐律之一发挥我的作用。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:73
translate chinese moxtalkm_98dcbf57:

    # mc "Here’s to that!"
    mc "为和平的未来干杯！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:75
translate chinese moxtalkm_815e1d5d:

    # mc "I’m not sure whether that should find that comforting or not."
    mc "我不确定我是否该为这一点感到宽慰。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:77
translate chinese moxtalkm_77f231ee:

    # mox "Welcome to the city. Just remember, the walls only keep some of the monsters out..."
    mox "总之欢迎来到城市。但要记住，高墙只能阻挡其中一些怪物。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:80
translate chinese moxtalkm_edbf26b0:

    # mc "Tell me about your friends and, I suppose, frenemies?"
    mc "和我说说你的朋友们吧，还有那些...亦敌亦友？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:82
translate chinese moxtalkm_5f1541d7:

    # mox "Did you say frenemy purely because of [lil]? Ahh, that girl… she has no respect."
    mox "亦敌亦友？你是说[lil]？啊，那女孩...他根本不懂尊重。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:83
translate chinese moxtalkm_cc24263b:

    # mox "I fucked up one of my first shows, {i}years ago{/i}, but what she fails to understand is that mistake doesn’t define my entire personality."
    mox "{i}年前{/i}，我搞砸过一场演出，那时我刚开始演艺事业，但她根本不明白一个错误没法定义我的整个人生。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:84
translate chinese moxtalkm_48f5dc5c:

    # mox "[pen] on the other hand, best friends for life, and we met the exact same way."
    mox "而我这辈子最好的朋友，[pen]就完全相反了，我们以完全一致的方式认识彼此。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:85
translate chinese moxtalkm_c10cd773:

    # mox "It really goes to show what a difference in attitude can do."
    mox "这真是说明了态度不同能带来多大的影响。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:88
translate chinese moxtalkm_ee0cb2bd:

    # mox "[pen] and I? We met after I fucked up one of my first shows and she bailed me out. Turns out, we had a lot in common. But that feels like ancient history, we've been best friends for years."
    mox "[pen]和我？还记得当时我搞砸了一开始的一场演出吧？她帮我解了围。结果我们发现互相之间有很多共同点。不过那感觉像是很久以前的事了，至于现在，我们已经做了很多年最好的朋友了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:89
translate chinese moxtalkm_ce4aebdb:

    # mox "That’s also how I met [lil]. She took a lot longer to warm up to me. But she’s come far. I’m glad to call her a friend."
    mox "也是在那次演出我认识了[lil]。她花了更长时间才对我敞开心扉，但她已经进步很多了，我还是很乐意称她为我的朋友的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:90
translate chinese moxtalkm_57e6c284:

    # mc "Is there anyone else?"
    mc "还有其他马你没提到的吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:92
translate chinese moxtalkm_d8e779fb:

    # mox "I have an amazing crew that helps me perform my shows. They’re really took a risk when they invested into me."
    mox "我有一群超棒的团队帮我完成一场场演出，他们往我身上投资真的付出了很大风险。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:93
translate chinese moxtalkm_778f6ecd:

    # mox "But it paid off and it’s been great for everyone involved. It’s less like a cold management company and more like a group of friends."
    mox "不过他们的投资最终还是有了回报，其中每一个人都度过了很棒的一段时光，他们不像那些冷酷无情的经纪公司，更像是一群朋友。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:94
translate chinese moxtalkm_30605da2:

    # mox "I couldn’t have gotten this far without their support. Maybe I’ll introduce you to them if we ever get the time."
    mox "要是没有他们的支持我肯定走不到今天这一步，如果我们之后还会度过更多时间的话也许我会向他们介绍你的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:96
translate chinese moxtalkm_e69c0cf7:

    # mox "And, of course, I’m quite looking forward to becoming great friends with the rest of the virtues."
    mox "当然，我也很希望和其他谐律们成为好朋友。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:104
translate chinese pentalkm_79a275b2:

    # mc "Newbie here! What exactly are you doing with those rings?"
    mc "嚯，新面孔！你要拿这些戒指做什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:106
translate chinese pentalkm_f53bda23:

    # pen "These are defensive rings. Magical currents are flowing through each of them like electricity."
    pen "这些是防御用的戒指。魔力如同电流一般，在每一枚戒指中流转。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:107
translate chinese pentalkm_1b284ff6:

    # pen "To my left is the control, a normal ring. In the middle here is my previous ring. To the right is my 'new and improved' ring."
    pen "在我的左手边是一个普通戒指，面前这枚是我之前用的戒指，右手边是我“全新升级版”戒指。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:108
translate chinese pentalkm_5a0ff8be:

    # pen "I'm recording the difference in how much the magical current is deceased and for how long."
    pen "我正在记录魔法电流衰减的程度以及衰减持续时长差异。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:109
translate chinese pentalkm_23f456fb:

    # pen "So far, so good. The middle ring cuts the current by 70%%, while the ring to the right cuts it by 90%%!"
    pen "目前为止，一切顺利。中间那枚戒指能将魔力电流削减70%%，而右边这枚“全新升级版”戒指则能削减90%%！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:110
translate chinese pentalkm_ff20e1fe:

    # mc "Initially fascinating. Somewhat boring to watch in context."
    mc "起初很吸引人，但放到整个场合下就有些乏味了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:112
translate chinese pentalkm_7b025880:

    # pen "Ahaha, isn't that the truth?"
    pen "啊哈哈，这难道不是事实吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:113
translate chinese pentalkm_892c26bc:

    # mc "What’s the craziest thing you’ve done with one of these relics?"
    mc "你用这些遗物做过的最疯狂的事是什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:115
translate chinese pentalkm_38cec84e:

    # pen "{i}Craziest{/i} thing? Well…"
    pen "{i}最疯狂{/i}的事？我想想..."

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:116
translate chinese pentalkm_7559253a:

    # pen "I suppose there was this time [lil] and I accidentally turned a room into a localized storm cloud."
    pen "记得有一次，我和[lil]不小心把一个房间变成了小型暴风云。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:117
translate chinese pentalkm_dc3805a8:

    # pen "Not exactly what the relic was supposed to do, but… a learning experience."
    pen "这可不是这件遗物的用处，不过……也算一次难得的经验。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:118
translate chinese pentalkm_9a39d039:

    # mc "You didn’t test it outside, or something?"
    mc "你当时没去外面测试，或干什么别的吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:120
translate chinese pentalkm_dbd0a125:

    # pen "Heh, pardon me, it was tested in a perfectly controlled environment. The problem was, uh, the ‘controlled’ part."
    pen "呵呵，不好意思，那是在一个完全可控的环境里测试的。问题就在于那‘可控’二字。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:121
translate chinese pentalkm_7017d429:

    # pen "It was just some dumb amplifying bracelet. It amplifies the caster’s magic, meaning if you give it a breeze, it gives you a hurricane."
    pen "它不过是一只魔力增幅手镯。它会放大施法者的魔力，也就是说你轻吹一下，就会产生一场飓风。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:122
translate chinese pentalkm_073c2060:

    # pen "Blew half our notes out the window before [lil] shut it down."
    pen "在[lil]把窗户关掉之前，它把我们一半的笔记都给吹出窗外了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:123
translate chinese pentalkm_57137901:

    # mc "Sounds like a nightmare."
    mc "听起来很糟糕。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:125
translate chinese pentalkm_126b3e41:

    # pen "A few bruises and soggy papers, but nothing permanent."
    pen "就留下几处淤青和几页被打湿的笔记，都不是什么大问题。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:126
translate chinese pentalkm_d91b84c0:

    # pen "And that’s the thing about relics. There’s actually no easy way to simply measure their activity, and it can be wildly inconsistent between people and even the time of day."
    pen "遗物就是这样，根本没有简单的方法能直接测量它们的活性，而且它们的效果不仅因人而异还随时间变化。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:128
translate chinese pentalkm_72f0d4ca:

    # pen "Even this experiment with the three rings. It's very controlled, unlike reality."
    pen "但这次不同，它们十分可控，不像我刚才说的那样。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:129
translate chinese pentalkm_b5f4324e:

    # pen "Even the smallest crack in an enchantment matrix can turn something useful into a disaster waiting to happen."
    pen "即便附魔矩阵中出现最细微的裂缝，也可能将原本有用的东西变成一触即发的灾难。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:130
translate chinese pentalkm_bb86e67a:

    # pen "For instance, what if my new ring accidentally amplified the magical current? There's a chance it could explode. Hence the protective barrier I placed around it."
    pen "比如说，如果我的新戒指不小心放大了魔力电流呢？那就有可能发生爆炸。所以我在它周围设置了保护屏障。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:131
translate chinese pentalkm_23186e0d:

    # mc "Do you ever worry about, you know, one going {i}really{/i} wrong?"
    mc "那你有曾设想过，比如说，万一有一次{i}彻底{/i}失控吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:133
translate chinese pentalkm_e12ac69b:

    # pen "All the time. It’s why I double – triple – check everything."
    pen "一直都有，所以我才要反复、再三、三番五次地检查每一个细节。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:134
translate chinese pentalkm_0e3b5575:

    # pen "A relic going wrong isn’t just dangerous for me, it could affect everyone that comes into contact with it."
    pen "一旦有一件遗物出差错，可不只是对我危险，接触到的所有人都会受到影响。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:135
translate chinese pentalkm_03d1d05a:

    # pen "But… that’s also what makes it fascinating. Every test, every adjustment, it’s like… those cubes with colourful squares, and you have to match every side. Each relic is its own puzzle."
    pen "但……正因为如此，它才如此迷人。每一次测试、每一次微调，就像魔方，你得让每一面都完美契合。每件遗物都是一个魔方。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:136
translate chinese pentalkm_5e532495:

    # pen "But it’s not all fun and games. Sometimes it’s long, draining weeks of nothing. Questioning whether I’m good enough…"
    pen "但这可不全是乐趣和游戏。有时候得花上漫长并艰难的几周，结果一无所获，让人怀疑自己是否够格。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:137
translate chinese pentalkm_82d2ca26:

    # pen "You have to love the process, or it’ll break you. I’ve said this many times to my colleagues, but if studying this field was more fun, it’d probably have already been done a century ago."
    pen "你得热爱这个过程，否则它摧毁你的意志。我对同事们说过无数次，如果研究这行真那么轻松有趣，估计一百年前就早已被人攻克了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:139
translate chinese pentalkm_7a267a73:

    # mc "You’re tired again, aren’t you?"
    mc "你又累了，对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:141
translate chinese pentalkm_f345567c:

    # pen "{i}Yaaawwwn{/i} Y-You can tell?"
    pen "{i}哈——啊{/i}（打呵欠声）你，你能看出来？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:142
translate chinese pentalkm_e7cd0638:

    # mc "Ever since I got to this universe. You’ve been running yourself ragged."
    mc "自从我来到这个世界，我就发现你一直拼命奔波。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:144
translate chinese pentalkm_bb3c40eb:

    # pen "All in the pursuit of greatness! Or something of that ilk."
    pen "全都是为了追求卓越！或差不多的目标。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:145
translate chinese pentalkm_605cfe84:

    # mc "How do you manage it all?"
    mc "你到底怎么撑得住？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:147
translate chinese pentalkm_672bab58:

    # pen "Manage? Hah, I don’t know if I’d qualify myself as doing that."
    pen "撑得住？哈，我才不敢说自己真的撑得住呢。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:148
translate chinese pentalkm_a34cf598:

    # pen "The university is demanding, and relics studies are unforgiving. If I’m not reading about them, I’m testing them. If I’m not testing them, I’m writing papers. And if I’m not writing papers…"
    pen "大学对我要求严苛，遗物研究更是毫不留情。我没读文献就在做实验，没做实验就在写论文，没写论文就……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:149
translate chinese pentalkm_ae6499bf:

    # mc "You’re sleeping?"
    mc "在睡觉？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:151
translate chinese pentalkm_56be8187:

    # pen "I wish. [lil] tries to remind me to take breaks, but I get… absorbed…"
    pen "我倒想呢。[lil]老是提醒我要休息，可我已经全身心投入进去了……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:152
translate chinese pentalkm_8eb639e8:

    # pen "There’s always something more to be done, something more to be learned."
    pen "总有做不完的事，总有学不尽的东西。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:153
translate chinese pentalkm_468f16df:

    # pen "And it’s not like the university makes it easy! Every professor has their own pet theories, and if you don’t align to their ‘vision,’ good luck getting published."
    pen "而且大学也不让人省心！每个教授都有自己偏爱的理论，不与他们的“愿景”对齐，就别想发表文章。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:154
translate chinese pentalkm_ba905a73:

    # mc "Ugh, faculty politics."
    mc "欸，学院的权力斗争真让人头大。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:156
translate chinese pentalkm_59f8ec06:

    # pen "{i}Exactly{/i}…"
    pen "{i}没错{/i}..."

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:157
translate chinese pentalkm_c5464b05:

    # pen "But whenever I’m feeling down, I think about how close I might be to something important…"
    pen "但每当我心情低落时，就会想到自己可能离重大突破有多近……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:158
translate chinese pentalkm_8617dc81:

    # pen "Like… imagine you’re working on a puzzle, and you’re down to the last few pieces. Would you walk away when you’re that close to finishing?"
    pen "想象一下，你在拼一副拼图，却只差最后几块。你会在就要完成的时候放弃吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:159
translate chinese pentalkm_faed40c5:

    # mc "Honestly, I might. What’s the point if it’s wearing you down?"
    mc "老实说，我可能会。累到透支的话这还有什么意义？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:161
translate chinese pentalkm_47a1a98a:

    # pen "Because if I don’t, someone else will. And they might not care as much about doing it right!"
    pen "因为如果我不做，就会有人替我去做。而他们也许根本不会在意要不要把它做好！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:162
translate chinese pentalkm_ebae4bd2:

    # pen "Besides, I love it. The challenge, the discoveries… even the chaos. It’s… it’s what I was meant to do."
    pen "况且，我热爱这份工作。挑战、发现……甚至混乱，都让我着迷不已。这...我想这就是我注定要走的路。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:163
translate chinese pentalkm_aa39f935:

    # mc "Just don’t let it mean losing yourself in the process. You’re more than just your work, you know."
    mc "只是别让自己在过程中迷失。代表你的不仅仅是你的工作，记住这一点。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:165
translate chinese pentalkm_360c9c07:

    # pen "Thanks. I’ll… try to keep that in mind."
    pen "谢谢，我想……我会记在心里的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:167
translate chinese pentalkm_1d92dcf8:

    # mc "So, Penelope… when all this is over, when you’ve got your degree and the university throws you some big fancy ceremony, what’s next for you?"
    mc "那么，Penelope……等这一切都结束了，你拿到学位、大学举办盛大的毕业典礼之后，下一步的打算是什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:169
translate chinese pentalkm_edfb86f2:

    # pen "Next? Keep studying, obviously. There’s always more to learn. I could spend decades in this field and still feel like I’m just scratching the surface."
    pen "下一步？显然还是继续深造。知识无穷无尽，我可能花几十年都只能学些皮毛。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:170
translate chinese pentalkm_46f31a19:

    # "Even more studying?! This girl is crazy!"
    "还要更深造？！这姑娘真是疯了！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:171
translate chinese pentalkm_e137e7da:

    # mc "And you’d be happy doing that forever?"
    mc "那么你这样学下去就会感到快乐吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:173
translate chinese pentalkm_66902b55:

    # pen "Yes and no. I love research, but… well, if I’m being honest, there’s one thing I’d like to achieve before I settle."
    pen "是，也不是。我热爱研究，但...说实话，在安定下来之前，我有一件事想要先达成。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:174
translate chinese pentalkm_db7b11fd:

    # mc "What’s that?"
    mc "是什么呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:176
translate chinese pentalkm_c0f33fdc:

    # pen "Permanent enchantments. Relics are incredible, but they wear out eventually. Even the most powerful ones have a limit. But imagine creating something that lasts—forever. No degradation, no expiry. It would revolutionize magic as we know it. The practical applications alone…"
    pen "永久性附魔。遗物都很强大，但终究会消耗失效。即便是最强的也有极限。可想象一下，若能创造出永不衰减、永不过期的遗物，那将彻底颠覆我们对魔法的认知，光是应用前景就很震撼……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:177
translate chinese pentalkm_76d8c876:

    # mc "And I’m guessing there’d be some serious money in it, too."
    mc "那我猜这其中有大钱，对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:179
translate chinese pentalkm_186acd52:

    # pen "Well… kind of. The fact current enchantments are temporary is actually an economic incentive, because you can sell more."
    pen "嗯……算是吧。现在的附魔都是临时的，正好符合经济利益——你能不断卖新的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:180
translate chinese pentalkm_95a2d05d:

    # pen "In other words, companies that sell relics would rather we {i}don't{/i} figure out how to make them permanent. Hence, this particular area of study gets little to no funding."
    pen "换句话说，那些卖遗物的公司可{i}不{/i}想我们搞出永久附魔。于是，这个方向基本得不到资助。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:181
translate chinese pentalkm_3ad0e7a7:

    # pen "It's actually kind of awful how the scientific procress largely directed by greed. Funds go to 'profitable' science."
    pen "说实话，被贪欲左右的科研过程真让人反感。经费都投向“大赚特赚”的项目。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:183
translate chinese pentalkm_c68662b7:

    # pen "That said, a breakthrough like that would still be worth a personal fortune. Not that I’m in it just for the money, but… it wouldn’t hurt."
    pen "不过，要是能突破那道坎，自己也能发笔大财。不是说我只为钱，但多点经费总没坏处。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:184
translate chinese pentalkm_63b3c0af:

    # pen "I could fund my own research, without relying on university grants and stuffy professors breathing down my neck."
    pen "我可以自己出钱搞研究，不用依赖那种学院拨款和那些甩不开的教授。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:185
translate chinese pentalkm_60920a92:

    # mc "Sounds ambitious. How close do you think you are?"
    mc "听起来很有野心。你觉得自己离目标还有多近？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:187
translate chinese pentalkm_f6fe5bb4:

    # pen "Closer than I’ve ever been. But that doesn’t mean much in this field. Sometimes it feels like I’m chasing a ghost, like I’ll figure it out tomorrow, or… never."
    pen "比任何时候都近。但在这行并不算什么，有时感觉像在追一团雾，明天能搞定，或永远也搞不定。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:188
translate chinese pentalkm_26b2e991:

    # mc "I think you’ll get there. You’re too smart and stubborn not to. Just… promise you’ll remember me when you’re rolling in gold and making history."
    mc "我相信你能成功。你聪明又倔强，绝不会轻易放弃。不过...答应我，等你腰缠万贯、载入史册时，可别忘了我。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:190
translate chinese pentalkm_ce139ac1:

    # pen "How could I forget? Besides, if I make it big, maybe I’ll finally have the time to… well, spend more of it with people I care about."
    pen "怎么会忘？况且要是我大有作为，也许才能抽出时间……多陪陪那些我在乎的人。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:191
translate chinese pentalkm_6c1b36d9:

    # mc "I’ll hold you to that."
    mc "那我等你兑现。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:194
translate chinese pentalkm_2da31e05:

    # pen "All done! Looks like my improvements have been a success in both magnitude and duration. Extrapolating this data shows that this ring could nullify 90%% of the magical charge for up to a week."
    pen "好了！看来我的改进在效果和持续时间上都很成功。根据数据推算，这枚戒指能在一周内削减 90%% 的魔力能量。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:195
translate chinese pentalkm_f0313cd2:

    # pen "In other words, for a city guard, it could last years of taking one or two hits every now and then."
    pen "换句话说，对城市警卫来说，偶尔用它一两次就能持续好几年。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:197
translate chinese pentalkm_6b628226:

    # pen "Hohoho, I can't wait to pen this all up!"
    pen "嘿嘿嘿，我等不及把这些都写进论文里！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:198
translate chinese pentalkm_1557d18a:

    # pen "Let's head back upstairs."
    pen "我们上楼去吧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:205
translate chinese liltalkm_1aab75da:

    # "I look over to her glowing computer monitor in the corner of the room. Sure, the technology existed in the other Arcadia, but this universe seems far more reliant on it."
    "我瞥向房间角落里她闪着光的显示屏。虽然另一个Arcadia有这技术，但这个世界显然更依赖它。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:206
translate chinese liltalkm_b1b61d09:

    # mc "I have to ask... how does magic and technology complement each other?"
    mc "我得问问……魔法和科技是如何互补的？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:208
translate chinese liltalkm_8e66d2f4:

    # lil "I suppose it may seem surprising if you're from a society that focuses on one without the other. However, magic and tech have been interwoven for centuries here."
    lil "如果你来自只注重其一的社会，可能会觉得奇怪。不过在这里，魔法和科技已经交织了几个世纪。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:210
translate chinese liltalkm_be0f822c:

    # lil "They complement each other. Spells are limited by the person and their abilities, while technology stands tall on its own. Unicorns aren’t as backwards as they act sometimes."
    lil "它们相辅相成。法术受施法者和其自身能力限制，而科技可以自成一体。有时那些独角兽看起来落后，其实并非如此。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:211
translate chinese liltalkm_92444855:

    # lil "For me, technology has always been a part of life, and life evolves. We adapt. People want convenience, not candlelight and scrolls. Sure, some purists hate it, but I think… it’s beautiful. Just like magic, tech isn’t static. It grows with us."
    lil "对我来说，科技一直都是生活的一部分，而生命在进化，生命会适应。我们想要便利，不想要烛光和卷轴。当然，有些纯粹派讨厌科技，但我觉得……它很美妙。和魔法一样，科技不会停滞，它和我们共同成长。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:212
translate chinese liltalkm_ff187b50:

    # mc "You sure you’re not hiding an engineering degree under all those spellbooks?"
    mc "你确定你厚厚一堆法术书里没藏个工程学学位？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:214
translate chinese liltalkm_f3442673:

    # lil "Ahah, not quite! But I do spend a lot of time tinkering in games. You’d be surprised how much strategy in MMOs feels like crafting a spell!"
    lil "哈哈，还没到那份上！不过我确实花很多时间在游戏里折腾。你会惊讶于好多大型网游的策略，就像在配置咒语一样！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:219
translate chinese liltalkm_f8656d14:

    # lil "Ahaha, don't knock our universe's games until you try them!"
    lil "哈哈哈，在没体验过我们世界的游戏之前，别先否定它们！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:220
translate chinese liltalkm_bfb44498:

    # lil "Besides, I think tech makes society more connected, more vibrant. Even if Arcadia doesn’t always get it right."
    lil "况且，我觉得科技让社会更紧密、更有活力。就算Arcadia并不总是完美的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:221
translate chinese liltalkm_34b9e02d:

    # mc "Not getting it right?"
    mc "不完美？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:223
translate chinese liltalkm_3c872749:

    # lil "Yeah. It’s easy to focus on how cool tech is when you live in the city. But some areas in the outskirts barely have electricity—"
    lil "是啊，住在城里很容易就被科技的酷炫迷住。但城郊有些地方连电都没几户通——"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:224
translate chinese liltalkm_97587054:

    # lil "… the city hasn’t always been great to those in the outskirts, and with the rapid expansion caused by refugees, it only got worse."
    lil "……这座城市对郊区的人并不友好，随着难民潮带来的快速扩张，情况更糟了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:225
translate chinese liltalkm_9b753b50:

    # lil "I’m hoping to change that."
    lil "我希望能改变这种状况。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:227
translate chinese liltalkm_681ab848:

    # mc "You’ve probably seen a different side of [aur] compared to the rest of the city. What’s she really like beneath the mask?"
    mc "你大概看过[aur]不为人知的一面。面具下的她究竟怎样？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:229
translate chinese liltalkm_9571e31a:

    # lil "She’s brilliant, no question. Charismatic, commanding, sharp as a blade!"
    lil "她很聪明，毫无疑问。富有魅力，气场强大，思维如快刀！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:230
translate chinese liltalkm_77fe6378:

    # lil "Being her student feels like… sometimes, it’s blinding."
    lil "做她学生的感觉……有时候真让我头晕目眩。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:231
translate chinese liltalkm_2aa7188c:

    # mc "{i}Blinding{/i}? Doesn’t that seem a bit much?"
    mc "{i}头晕目眩{/i}？不会太过了吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:233
translate chinese liltalkm_bca55fa9:

    # lil "[aur] can be quite intense and demanding. She sees potential and pulls it out of you, whether you’re ready or not."
    lil "[aur]有时会强势严苛。只要她看见潜力，就会把它挖掘出来，不管你准备好了没。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:234
translate chinese liltalkm_1654f43e:

    # lil "That was before, anyway… Around the time you came into the picture, it’d been months since I’d last seen her, and she’d only rarely reply to my letters."
    lil "那是以前……不管怎样，就在你出现前后，我已经几个月没见她了，给她写信她也很少回。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:235
translate chinese liltalkm_e0d3da6e:

    # lil "She built Arcadia into what it is. She was just… focused on strength. Too focused."
    lil "是她将Arcadia打造成如今这般。她只是……过于专注于力量了，太过了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:237
translate chinese liltalkm_0d02b610:

    # mc "People talk about her like she’s a dictator."
    mc "人们都说她像个独裁者。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:239
translate chinese liltalkm_e7090c64:

    # lil "S-She’s not a dictator. Not yet. But she’s walking that line. [aur] believes power keeps peace, that Arcadia’s magic is its shield. I understand her logic, but…"
    lil "她...她还不是独裁者。至少还没到那一步。但她正朝那条路走。[aur]认为力量能保障和平，Arcadia的魔法就是它的护盾。我明白她的逻辑，可是……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:240
translate chinese liltalkm_cfc29a2a:

    # lil "I have to prove her wrong."
    lil "我必须证明她错了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:241
translate chinese liltalkm_e8b61ba7:

    # mc "Prove her wrong how?"
    mc "怎么证明？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:243
translate chinese liltalkm_ef4875e8:

    # lil "By showing her that power isn’t just about force. It’s about understanding people, connecting with them. Maybe then, I’ll feel like I’ve earned the place she sees for me."
    lil "我要向她展示，武力不代表力量。力量也在于理解他人、与他们建立连接。也许那时，我才能真心觉得自己配得上她对我的期望。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:245
translate chinese liltalkm_e8f3eb3f:

    # lil "Of course, we saw why. I just wish she’d been a little more honest about her intentions."
    lil "当然，我们早就知道原因了。只是我希望她当初能更坦诚些。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:246
translate chinese liltalkm_f365def8:

    # mc "I get why she didn’t want to tell everyone that the world-ending threat was her sister, though."
    mc "不过我也理解她不愿告诉所有人，导致世界末日的是她妹妹。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:248
translate chinese liltalkm_b1299b7b:

    # lil "If you think that cover up is wild, just wait until you hear about the new cover up. [sel] has been introduced to the city as a hero that was undercover for years."
    lil "要说当年的掩饰让人震惊，那就等你听听更炸裂的，[sel]被当作多年的秘密卧底英雄介绍给了全城。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:249
translate chinese liltalkm_9e6d9131:

    # mc "Interesting… I suppose that neatly ties things up."
    mc "有意思……估计一切就此圆满交代了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:250
translate chinese liltalkm_c0787400:

    # lil "I wish these things didn’t have to feel so icky. If I ever rule, I want to do things honestly from the start."
    lil "我真希望这些事不必弄得这么令人作呕。倘若我当上掌权者，从一开始我就会说实话。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:252
translate chinese liltalkm_7f52d6b4:

    # mc "Tell me about you."
    mc "说说你自己呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:254
translate chinese liltalkm_9cdb04e2:

    # lil "Me? There’s not much to say."
    lil "我？我没什么好说的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:255
translate chinese liltalkm_82484378:

    # mc "That’s modest and you know it. You’re studying under the Queen, playing ambassador, and apparently have time to conquer MMOs. You definitely have some stories."
    mc "你知道你这是谦虚了，你在女王手下学习，还担任着大使，居然还有时间打网游通关。你肯定有不少故事可讲。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:257
translate chinese liltalkm_df8ecdfe:

    # lil "Fine. Um… well, I love magic, obviously. I wanted to be a master spellcaster when I was younger, inventing my own spells, teaching others. But… then politics happened."
    lil "行吧。嗯……是这样，显而易见——我很热爱魔法。小时候我想成为一名魔法大师，发明自己的咒语并教给别人。但……后来就卷入政治了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:258
translate chinese liltalkm_e6854b73:

    # mc "Oh no, not politics."
    mc "唉，可别是政治有关的"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:260
translate chinese liltalkm_3842dc0a:

    # lil "[aur] thought I had potential, so she brought me under her wing. At first, it felt amazing—like I mattered. But the more assignments I got, the more it felt like I was being… boxed in."
    lil "Aurora觉得我很有潜力，所以把我收入门下。一开始，那种感觉好极了——好像自己很重要似的。但后来任务越来越多，我越来越觉得自己像是被……困住了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:261
translate chinese liltalkm_bfe920c5:

    # lil "Magic became secondary, and I got stuck in meetings and essays about laws and trade."
    lil "魔法就成了次要的事，我整天陷在开会和写那些关于法律、贸易的文章里。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:262
translate chinese liltalkm_fd7cb62e:

    # lil "And it’s not that I really dislike the political aspects of my role, but the state of the country was a mess."
    lil "倒不是说我真的讨厌自己职责里那些政治相关的部分，只是国家当时的状况一团糟。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:263
translate chinese liltalkm_fe265def:

    # mc "So… you lost sight of what you wanted."
    mc "所以……你渐渐忘了自己真正想要的是什么。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:265
translate chinese liltalkm_cd076860:

    # lil "Yeah. I let it slip away. I even stopped trying to connect with people."
    lil "是啊。我就任由它溜走了。我甚至都不再试着跟马们打交道了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:266
translate chinese liltalkm_d572d225:

    # lil "Gaming became my escape, my one place where I felt… capable. But lately, I’ve realized that running away won’t help. I want to try again—to be the person I always dreamed of."
    lil "打游戏成了我的逃避方式，那是唯一一个能让我感觉自己……还行的地方。但最近我意识到，逃避根本没用。我想再试一次——成为我一直梦想成为的那种马。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:267
translate chinese liltalkm_889ab641:

    # mc "And what’s that look like? What’s your dream [lil] like?"
    mc "那具体是什么样子？你的梦想是什么样的？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:269
translate chinese liltalkm_8d954b8d:

    # lil "Someone who makes a difference. I don’t know if I’ll ever get there, but… I want to try."
    lil "我想能改变些什么。我不知道我会不会成功，但是...我想试试。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:270
translate chinese liltalkm_dff24449:

    # mc "I think you’re already closer than you think. Dream [lil] can still have fun, right?"
    mc "我觉得你已经很接近了。完美的[lil]仍然有空找找乐子，对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:272
translate chinese liltalkm_83d130e8:

    # lil "Dream [lil] definitely still raids on weekends."
    lil "完美的[lil]绝对有空在周末玩点什么。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:274
translate chinese liltalkm_ef7666ab:

    # lil "It's been a pleasure talking with you."
    lil "和你交流很愉快。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:281
translate chinese hontalkm_31c10e0e:

    # mc "So, [hon]… Any advice for someone clueless in these parts?"
    mc "所以，[hon]...对于我这个对这儿一无所知的家伙有什么建议吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:283
translate chinese hontalkm_42279088:

    # hon "Well, reckon the first thing is stoppin’ callin’ yerself clueless. Ain’t no quicker way to spook folks than actin’ like ya lost in the woods."
    hon "嗯，你不能老觉得自己日子没盼头。一直在生活的迷宫中迷路还是太吓人了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:284
translate chinese hontalkm_ebacee62:

    # hon "Confidence, even if it’s fake, goes a long way."
    hon "哪怕是毫无来源的自信也大有帮助。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:285
translate chinese hontalkm_c9e781a8:

    # mc "Fake it until I make it? Uh, sure, noted."
    mc "假也就是说，要装自信，直到我找到自信的来源？行，记下了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:286
translate chinese hontalkm_3aab4be9:

    # mc "Any tips for things to avoid?"
    mc "生活中有什么要注意的事情吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:288
translate chinese hontalkm_dae5d68a:

    # hon "City folk! Kidding— mostly~"
    hon "城里人！会骗人！好吧，只是大多数是~"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:289
translate chinese hontalkm_c4320e3d:

    # hon "Seriously though, develop a keen sense for those types only interested in using you. Ain’t always honest work behind a polished smile."
    hon "说真的，你可得时刻提防着那些只是想利用你的人。你可从笑面虎那得不到什么好处。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:291
translate chinese hontalkm_be25a4ba:

    # hon "But if you want someone who’ll stick by you, I’d say you’re walking next to one, stud."
    hon "不过你要是想找个真心朋友，你身边可就有一位呢。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:292
translate chinese hontalkm_5b8e3fae:

    # mc "Heh, good to know."
    mc "哈，好建议。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:294
translate chinese hontalkm_b248396d:

    # hon "Oh, and one word of advice. The roads are out there for a reason. Don’t pick a direction and just walk out there. Giant bears have been spotted as short as a mile away."
    hon "噢，我还有一个建议。路的存在都是有原因的。别随便选个方向然后就走了。那样的话，等你看见危险时就已经太迟了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:295
translate chinese hontalkm_7646faa9:

    # mc "Eeehhhh… also good to know…"
    mc "呃...也是个好建议。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:296
translate chinese hontalkm_551a160e:

    # "Man, even with technological advancements, this universe’s wilderness is full of monsters too!"
    "天呐，哪怕有着科技的加持，这个世界的荒野里也满是怪物啊！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:298
translate chinese hontalkm_1f4668ba:

    # mc "So… honest opinion. What do you think about me so far?"
    mc "还有就是...你觉得我怎么样？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:300
translate chinese hontalkm_866e837f:

    # hon "Sugarcoated, or real deal, hun?"
    hon "那要看你是想听善意的谎言还是真心话呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:301
translate chinese hontalkm_bdcd751a:

    # mc "Skip the sugar. Hit me with the real deal."
    mc "别在粉饰了。告诉我你真实的想法。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:303
translate chinese hontalkm_67772960:

    # hon "Alright. You got potential. {i}Husband{/i} potential. You’re quick on your feet and got enough wit to keep a conversation goin’—even when you don’t know what you’re talkin’ about."
    hon "行吧。你挺有潜力的。作为{i}丈夫{/i}的潜力。你反应快，机灵劲儿够用，能把话题撑起来——哪怕你根本搞不清自己在交流什么。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:304
translate chinese hontalkm_40017ba5:

    # mc "That was a compliment, right?"
    mc "这是在夸我吧，是吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:306
translate chinese hontalkm_8a01976a:

    # hon "Yeah, what I means is, you’re still green. But I’m good at growing greens~"
    hon "是啊，我的意思是，你还很青涩。而我可是种绿叶菜的行家~"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:307
translate chinese hontalkm_e43adfda:

    # mc "Holy shit, that was actually smooth."
    mc "靠，那这操作有够顺溜的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:309
translate chinese hontalkm_842e2975:

    # mc "How’s the farm doing?"
    mc "农场的生意怎么样？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:312
translate chinese hontalkm_cbd4bb99:

    # hon "It's been getting significantly better. I feel like for once I'm not always playing catchup. I can even finish work before sundown!"
    hon "情况已经明显好转了。我感觉自己终于不必总是追赶进度了。甚至能在日落前完成工作！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:313
translate chinese hontalkm_7313ca1b:

    # hon "If it wasn’t for your help, I don’t think we’d have a future."
    hon "若没有你的帮助，我们恐怕就不会有未来了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:314
translate chinese hontalkm_eee62917:

    # hon "Now? I have the tractor set to cruise control, stud. Productivity is up 400%%. Even I’m starting to have plenty of free time."
    hon "但是现在？我已经把拖拉机调到定速巡航模式了，伙计。生产力提升了400%%。连我都开始有大量空闲时间了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:316
translate chinese hontalkm_6f9d74e4:

    # hon "Me, a social life! Who’da thunk?"
    hon "我，居然还能有社交生活！辣个能想得到赛？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:317
translate chinese hontalkm_da85da0e:

    # hon "I could work harder and expand, but I'm not in the empire business."
    hon "我本可以更努力地拓展业务，但我没心思打造什么商业帝国。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:318
translate chinese hontalkm_bd7ff25a:

    # hon "I just want to have a fun life, and it’s time to play catch up."
    hon "我只想过个快乐的人生，现在该是补回失去的时光了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:320
translate chinese hontalkm_0f0cc0c5:

    # hon "Putting it lightly? Probably the worst state it’s ever been in."
    hon "说得委婉点？恐怕是它有史以来最糟糕的状态了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:321
translate chinese hontalkm_cce77c44:

    # hon "Weather’s been awful, and with only two workers there’s a lot of catching up to do."
    hon "天气一直不好，加上只有两个工人，有许多工作需要赶工。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:322
translate chinese hontalkm_7b9d21ce:

    # hon "But if I were to have a hope for the future… I’d like to start by buying modern equipment to speed things up massively."
    hon "但若尚我对未来抱有希望……我想首先购置现代化设备，大幅提升工作效率。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:324
translate chinese hontalkm_f9572c26:

    # hon "The main issue is that we lack the funds to make a leap like that, and it may take years until we do."
    hon "主要问题在于我们缺乏实现如此飞跃所需的资金，而筹集资金可能需要数年时间。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:325
translate chinese hontalkm_83718df4:

    # hon "And… [blo], bless her. I don’t want to keep her working here for the rest of her life. She has too much potential for that…"
    hon "而且……[blo]，可怜的姑娘。我可不想让她在这儿干一辈子。她有这么大的潜力，实在不该这样……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:326
translate chinese hontalkm_863230d4:

    # "I have to help them somehow. I should follow up on that letter with [blo]."
    "我必须想办法帮帮他们。我应该就那封信跟进一下[blo]。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:335
translate chinese blotalkm_93d4f5ef:

    # mc "You know, I’ve heard bits and pieces from [hon] about how life’s been on the farm, but… what about you? What’s your story?"
    mc "你知道吗，我从[hon]那里零零碎碎听过些农场生活的事，但……你呢？你的故事是怎样的？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:337
translate chinese blotalkm_6da31b53:

    # blo "Not much to tell, really. Been here pretty much my whole life. Wake up, work the fields, try not to fall asleep before dinner. Rinse and repeat."
    blo "实在没什么好说的。我几乎一辈子都待在这儿。起床，下地干活，尽量别在晚饭前睡着。日复一日，循环往复。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:338
translate chinese blotalkm_6e316168:

    # blo "Not exactly the stuff of legends."
    blo "实在算不上什么传奇故事。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:339
translate chinese blotalkm_63f7856e:

    # mc "Come on, I’m sure there’s more to it than that. No hobbies? Big dreams? Moments where you felt like the world opened up a little?"
    mc "得了吧，我敢肯定事情没这么简单。没有爱好？没有远大理想？没有那些感觉世界豁然开朗的瞬间？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:341
translate chinese blotalkm_895162a0:

    # blo "Big dreams, sure. I always wanted to leave this place, make new friends, and study music… But dreams don’t keep a roof over your head or a farm from fallin’ apart."
    blo "大梦想，当然有。我一直想离开这地方，结交新朋友，学习音乐……但梦想既不能给你遮风挡雨，也救不了快要垮掉的农场。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:342
translate chinese blotalkm_505c2707:

    # blo "For me, life was about doin’ what I have to, not what I want to."
    blo "对我来说，生活就是做必须做的事，而不是想做的事。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:343
translate chinese blotalkm_b64d166e:

    # mc "That can’t be easy."
    mc "那可不容易。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:345
translate chinese blotalkm_07927986:

    # blo "Yeah. But what can you do? [hon] works harder than anyone I know. She needed me. And… well, I couldn’t live with myself if I just up and left her to deal with all this alone."
    blo "是啊。但又能怎么办呢？[hon] 比我认识的任何人都努力。她需要我。而且……唉，要是我就这么一走了之，让她独自面对这一切，我会这辈子都没法面对自己。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:347
translate chinese blotalkm_6a0349db:

    # blo "Besides, it wasn’t totally bad. I still got to learn music in my spare time, even if it’s just to my cricket friends."
    blo "况且，也不是完全糟糕。我依然能在闲暇时学习音乐，哪怕只是给我的板球伙伴们弹奏。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:348
translate chinese blotalkm_c7a763e3:

    # blo "And anyone would be lucky to have a sister like [hon]."
    blo "能有[hon]这样的姐姐，任何人在这位置都算得上是幸运儿。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:349
translate chinese blotalkm_95da90d1:

    # mc "Anybody would be lucky to have a sister like {i}you{/i}, [blo]."
    mc "能有你这样的妹妹，{i}你{/i}真是太幸运了，[blo]。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:351
translate chinese blotalkm_4f3638a5:

    # blo "Y-You really mean that?"
    blo "你·你真的这么觉得？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:353
translate chinese blotalkm_4597b482:

    # mc "You ever spend much time in the city? It’s a lot to take in."
    mc "你常在城里待着吗？那地方可真够让人应接不暇的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:355
translate chinese blotalkm_f528e0cd:

    # blo "Not much, no. [hon] usually goes if we need somethin’ we can’t grow or fix ourselves. I’ve been a handful of times, though. It’s different to the countryside."
    blo "没多少，真的。[hon] 通常是去买些我们自己种不了或修不好的东西。不过我也去过几次。和乡下可不一样。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:356
translate chinese blotalkm_5842c91a:

    # mc "Different how?"
    mc "有什么不同？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:358
translate chinese blotalkm_6f1db641:

    # blo "Busy. Loud. Feels like everyone’s in a hurry, but no one knows where they’re going."
    blo "喧嚣。嘈杂。仿佛人人都在匆匆赶路，却无人知晓自己要去向何方。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:359
translate chinese blotalkm_c1c4ff6d:

    # blo "But I get why folks like it. The food is gorgeous; if I’m ever lucky enough to go to a restaurant, you can be sure that I’m taking notes on the recipes."
    blo "但我明白人们为何喜欢都市。菜品精美绝伦；若我有幸去餐厅用餐，准会把配方记录得一清二楚。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:360
translate chinese blotalkm_0f3845fc:

    # blo "I think I'm happier living out in the countryside. But sometimes I wonder what it’d be like to live out there, even just for a little while. To see shows, meet people who don’t already know everything about you…"
    blo "我觉得住在乡下更快乐。但有时我也会好奇，若能去那里生活会是怎样的滋味——哪怕只是短暂片刻。去看演出，遇见那些还不了解你全部的人……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:361
translate chinese blotalkm_9794f1c4:

    # mc "Doesn’t sound impossible. Maybe one day you’ll find a way to make it happen."
    mc "听起来并非不可能。或许有一天你会找到实现它的方法。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:363
translate chinese blotalkm_e070c926:

    # blo "Certainly sounds better than wondering about it all day."
    blo "听起来确实比整天琢磨这件事要好得多。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:366
translate chinese blotalkm_c69ea757:

    # blo "So, up north, you’ve got the cow towns. They’re mostly small places, full of ranchers and folks raising livestock. Honest people, but don’t expect much hospitality if you don’t have anything to offer. Their culture is very much rooted in trade."
    blo "哦，在北方，有些牛人的村镇。这些地方大多规模不大，住着农场主和养牲畜的人。他们都是老实人，但若你没什么可提供的，就别指望他们会热情好客。他们的文化根基深深扎根于贸易之中。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:367
translate chinese blotalkm_90d5a15b:

    # mc "Sounds like a good place for a drink."
    mc "听起来是个喝一杯的好地方。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:369
translate chinese blotalkm_d45e2b36:

    # blo "Maybe. Just don’t let them catch you being hoity. They don’t take kindly to that."
    blo "也许吧。但千万别让他们发现你摆架子，他们可不吃这一套。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:370
translate chinese blotalkm_2611d543:

    # blo "Now, over here…"
    blo "现在，这边来……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:371
translate chinese blotalkm_a1ba006c:

    # "She points out of her window to a forest in the distance."
    "她指着窗外远处的一片森林。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:373
translate chinese blotalkm_a11fde96:

    # blo "That’s Nevermore forest. Pretty, sure, but it’s easy to get lost if you’re not careful."
    blo "那是无尽森林。美得令人窒息，但稍不留神就会迷失方向。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:374
translate chinese blotalkm_acea6f8d:

    # blo "Lots of wild critters, too. Some friendly, some… not so much. [hon] always says it’s best to stick to the paths, rather than picking a direction and walking in it."
    blo "野地里还有不少野生小动物。有些友善，有些嘛……就不那么友善了。[hon] 总说最好沿着小路走，别随便选个方向就往前闯。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:375
translate chinese blotalkm_7066a64c:

    # mc "You’ve been there yourself?"
    mc "你有过这样的经历嘛？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:377
translate chinese blotalkm_1d9e10b8:

    # blo "Sometimes. It’s worth the risk. The way the sun filters through the trees, the sound of the birds… it’s like bein’ in a whole different world."
    blo "有几次。值得冒冒险。那阳光穿过树梢的模样，鸟儿的鸣唱声……仿佛置身于另一个世界。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:378
translate chinese blotalkm_74a883ea:

    # blo "If you go east instead... Well, you’ve likely seen the gigantic ravine that cuts through the city."
    blo "若你向东行去……嗯，你大概已经看见那道横贯城市的巨大峡谷了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:380
translate chinese blotalkm_4fb3bf20:

    # blo "Steep as it gets, but there’s a river at the bottom. Great place to think if you’re feelin’ overwhelmed. Just remember that every step down is a step you’ll have to take back up. Ain’t nobody comin’ to pull you out."
    blo "陡峭得令人窒息，但山脚有条河流。若你感到心中不堪重负，那正是沉思良地。只管记住：每往下踏一步，便得要再往上爬一步。可没人会来拉你一把。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:381
translate chinese blotalkm_f54b6855:

    # mc "Noted. So, northern cow towns for grit, the western forest for getting lost, and the eastern ravine for some alone time. What if you were to go even further than that?"
    mc "明白了。所以，北方牛镇磨练意志，西部森林迷失自我，东部峡谷独处静思。如果你走得更远些呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:383
translate chinese blotalkm_a5507958:

    # blo "Really far north? Very mountainous, very cold, and wild monster girl territory. Get over that hump, though, and you’ll be in the Crystal Kingdom, a town famous for magical blacksmithing."
    blo "极北之地？山峦叠嶂，寒气逼人，还是野性怪物少女的领地。不过翻过那座山脊，你便会抵达水晶王国——一座以魔法锻造闻名的城镇。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:384
translate chinese blotalkm_91370eb2:

    # blo "If you were to follow the river of the ravine, you’ll end up at the most beautiful waterfall in the country, Cadia Falls. It’s like the whole world decided to pour itself over the edge of a cliff, just to remind you how powerful it can be."
    blo "若沿着峡谷中的溪流前行，终将抵达全国最美的瀑布——卡迪亚瀑布。它仿佛是整个世界决定倾泻而下，从悬崖边缘奔涌而出，只为提醒你自然力量何其磅礴。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:385
translate chinese blotalkm_3c618fa4:

    # blo "The mist hangs in the air, catchin’ the sunlight. And the roar—it’s not just loud. It’s alive. You feel it in your chest."
    blo "雾气悬浮空中，捕捉着阳光。而那轰鸣——不仅响亮，更充满生命力。你能感受到它在胸腔中震颤。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:387
translate chinese blotalkm_18370f15:

    # blo "Far west, past Nevermore Forest, no one goes there anymore. That’s the direction of the dark lands, and the only landmarks before that are Old Arcadia and Evergaol Prison."
    blo "远西之地，越过无尽森林，再无人踏足。是黑暗之地的方向，那之前唯一的标志物只有古Arcadia与永恒监狱。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:390
translate chinese blotalkm_3073e127:

    # blo "This has been nice. Thank you."
    blo "咱们聊的很愉快。谢谢你。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:398
translate chinese rubtalkm_62188926:

    # mc "Is there anything more you can tell me about yourself, [rub]? What makes you tick?"
    mc "关于你自己，[rub]，还有什么能告诉我的吗？是什么让你如此着迷？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:400
translate chinese rubtalkm_2a192bb9:

    # rub "That can be a dangerous question, darling. You sure you’re ready for the answer?"
    rub "亲爱的，这个问题可危险了。你确定准备好听答案了吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:401
translate chinese rubtalkm_9f3b2898:

    # mc "I’ll take my chances~"
    mc "我愿意冒险一试~"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:403
translate chinese rubtalkm_26811022:

    # rub "{i}*Giggle*{/i} Alright, but don’t say I didn’t warn you."
    rub "{i}*咯咯笑*{/i} 好吧，可别说我没提醒过你。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:404
translate chinese rubtalkm_e16fd441:

    # rub "As you know, I’m a collector of experiences. I believe life is measured not in years but in the moments that make your heart race, your soul ache, or your body sing."
    rub "如你所知，我是一个体验的收藏者。我深信生命的价值不在于岁月长短，而在于那些令你心跳加速、灵魂颤动、身体欢唱的瞬间。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:405
translate chinese rubtalkm_b808344d:

    # rub "Everything I do, including running this brothel, serves that purpose."
    rub "我所做的一切，包括经营这家妓院，都是为了这个目的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:406
translate chinese rubtalkm_9c7b3b06:

    # mc "Why a brothel, though? I imagine you could’ve chosen a variety of paths. Why this one?"
    mc "可为什么偏偏是妓院呢？我想你本可以选择多种道路，为何偏偏选了这条？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:408
translate chinese rubtalkm_689916bb:

    # rub "This place isn’t just about physical pleasure. It’s a sanctuary for exploration—intellectual, emotional, and yes, physical."
    rub "此地不仅关乎肉体欢愉，更是一处探索的圣所——智性的、情感的，当然，还有肉体的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:409
translate chinese rubtalkm_f2c95b2c:

    # rub "People come here to feel alive in ways they didn’t think were possible. It’s messy, it’s raw, but it’s real."
    rub "人们来到这里，体验前所未有的生命力。这里混乱而原始，却真实得令人窒息。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:410
translate chinese rubtalkm_0f4afb9b:

    # rub "Where else but here could I help people experience all that and still keep the lights on?"
    rub "除了这里，还有哪里能让我既帮助人们体验这一切，又能维持生计呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:411
translate chinese rubtalkm_e1cc8177:

    # mc "And it’s all tied to your philosophy? Experiences above all?"
    mc "这一切都与你的哲学观有关？体验至上？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:413
translate chinese rubtalkm_3e4b0798:

    # rub "Exactly. You see, life has no guarantees. Everything can be taken from you in an instant. So why not chase the things that make you feel? Why not leave the world knowing you lived it fully?"
    rub "确实如此。你看，人生没有保证。一切都可能在瞬间被夺走。那么，何不追寻那些能让你心潮澎湃的事物？何不带着活得淋漓尽致的觉悟离开这个世界？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:414
translate chinese rubtalkm_52ce1c9b:

    # mc "That sounds as liberating as it does terrifying."
    mc "这听起来既令人感到解放，又令人感到恐惧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:415
translate chinese rubtalkm_4a79f778:

    # rub "It’s both. But fear is just another sensation. Learn to savor it, and you’ll start to see the beauty in every moment."
    rub "两者兼而有之。但恐惧不过是另一种感官体验。学会品味它，你便能发现每个瞬间的美好。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:417
translate chinese rubtalkm_f0b8b68b:

    # mc "So, as someone who’s all about experiences, what’s the most interesting one you’ve had?"
    mc "作为一个热衷于体验的人，你经历过最有趣的事情是什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:419
translate chinese rubtalkm_fe7fe371:

    # rub "Do you mean interesting or transformative? Because they’re rarely the same thing."
    rub "你是指有趣还是具有变革性？因为这两者极少是同一回事。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:420
translate chinese rubtalkm_666306b5:

    # mc "Um… Both. Start with interesting."
    mc "嗯……两者都有。先从有趣的开始。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:422
translate chinese rubtalkm_239163ad:

    # rub "There was a time I danced in a moonlit forest with a group of dryads. I visited Eldergrove several years ago, and it was the most gorgeous city I’ve ever seen. Their architecture was perfectly harmonious with the trees."
    rub "曾几何时，我与一群树精在月光森林中翩然起舞。那是我数年前造访长者林时，我此生所见最绚丽的城池，其建筑与林木浑然天成，完美交融。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:423
translate chinese rubtalkm_dfdf0725:

    # mc "It sounds hard to top that. Is there where you met the dryad dancer that works here?"
    mc "这似乎难以超越。你是在这里遇见那位在此工作的树精舞者的吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:425
translate chinese rubtalkm_c85f440f:

    # rub "Precisely, dear~"
    rub "正是如此，亲爱的~"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:426
translate chinese rubtalkm_e6313ab1:

    # mc "What about transformative?"
    mc "那“变革性的”呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:428
translate chinese rubtalkm_7f43352d:

    # rub "The day I realized that experiences aren’t just for the moment. They leave marks. But all of them shape who you become. It’s not always pleasant."
    rub "当我意识到，经历不仅属于当下。它们会留下印记。但所有印记都塑造着你所成为的人。这过程未必总是愉悦。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:429
translate chinese rubtalkm_569ce034:

    # mc "Oh? It wasn’t actually an {i}experience{/i}, but a thought?"
    mc "哦？那其实不是一次{i}体验{/i}，而是一种想法？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:431
translate chinese rubtalkm_c115cb7f:

    # rub "Experiences aren’t things you can box in. The most profound can be discovered at the most mundane of times."
    rub "体验并非能装进盒子里的事物。最深刻的体验往往在最平凡的时刻悄然显现。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:432
translate chinese rubtalkm_d41c8116:

    # rub "This particular discovery, however, was related to my sister."
    rub "然而，这个特殊的发现与我的妹妹有关。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:433
translate chinese rubtalkm_ba62a9f9:

    # mc "I see. Is there one experience you think everyone should have?"
    mc "我明白了。你觉得每个人都应该有过一次什么样的经历？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:435
translate chinese rubtalkm_5bcc05fd:

    # rub "Falling in love. Deeply, recklessly, beautifully. Not just with a person, but with a place, a dream, or even an idea."
    rub "坠入爱河。深沉地、不顾一切地、美丽地。不仅可以对一个人，也可以是对一个地方、一个梦想，甚至一个理念。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:436
translate chinese rubtalkm_e66462a2:

    # rub "Let it consume you. Let it break you if it must. Because only then will you understand what it means to truly live."
    rub "任它吞噬你。若有必要，就让它击垮你。因为唯有如此，你才会明白何为真正地活着。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:437
translate chinese rubtalkm_b71aed22:

    # mc "You make love sound a little scary!"
    mc "你把爱说得有点可怕哩！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:439
translate chinese rubtalkm_f686ce62:

    # rub "Oh, darling, it can be terrifying. But that’s what makes it worthwhile."
    rub "哦，亲爱的，这可能令人胆战心惊。但正因如此才值得一试。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:441
translate chinese rubtalkm_56fe615d:

    # mc "You seem to know this city better than anyone. What’s the best way to get to know it?"
    mc "你似乎比任何人都更了解这座城市。了解它的最佳方式是什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:443
translate chinese rubtalkm_be44f1a1:

    # rub "Start by getting lost. The city doesn’t reveal itself to people who stick to maps and schedules."
    rub "先迷失方向。这座城市不会向那些死守地图和行程表的人展现真容。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:444
translate chinese rubtalkm_1f0023c3:

    # rub "Wander. Listen. Taste. You’ll learn more in one aimless evening than in a week of asking questions."
    rub "当街溜子。听声音。吃美食。一个漫无目的的夜晚，你所收获的，可能远胜过一周的追问。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:445
translate chinese rubtalkm_762fac9d:

    # mc "Sounds like advice from someone who’s gotten lost more than once."
    mc "听起来像是来自某个不止一次迷路的人的建议。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:447
translate chinese rubtalkm_b670bded:

    # rub "Guilty as charged. Some of my best discoveries came from wrong turns. A hidden café, a forbidden library, a comedy club run by cats girls—this city rewards curiosity."
    rub "罪名成立。我最精彩的发现往往源于“误入歧途”。隐秘的咖啡馆、幽闭的图书馆、猫娘经营的喜剧俱乐部——这座城市总会犒赏好奇心。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:448
translate chinese rubtalkm_96f56a44:

    # mc "And what about the people? Any advice there?"
    mc "那对于其中之人你有什么见解吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:450
translate chinese rubtalkm_2df42ddf:

    # rub "People are like mirrors. Show them fear, and they’ll reflect it. Show them confidence, and they’ll admire it."
    rub "人们如同镜子。向他们展示恐惧，他们便映出恐惧；向他们展现自信，他们便心生敬佩。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:451
translate chinese rubtalkm_73d6ea8e:

    # rub "But if you really want to understand someone, show them vulnerability. That’s when they reveal who they are."
    rub "但若你真想了解一个人，就向他展现脆弱。那才是他展露真我之时。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:452
translate chinese rubtalkm_d6671e1a:

    # mc "You sound like a real risk-taker."
    mc "你听起来真是个敢于冒险的人。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:454
translate chinese rubtalkm_00a8a9eb:

    # rub "Life is risk. If you play it safe, stick to the surface, you’ll never drown, but you’ll never dive deep enough to find the treasure, either."
    rub "人生即冒险。若你谨小慎微，只在水面游弋，固然永不溺亡，却也永远无法潜入深处寻获珍宝。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:455
translate chinese rubtalkm_3d2e0b90:

    # mc "And I suppose you dive deep?"
    mc "那我猜你会潜得很深？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:457
translate chinese rubtalkm_30281f6a:

    # rub "Every chance I get. But the real question is… are you brave enough to join me?"
    rub "每次有机会我都会。但真正的问题是……你有足够的勇气加入我吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:459
translate chinese rubtalkm_8a7cc6f9:

    # "[rub] and I continued to talk about our experiences for a little longer."
    "[rub] 和我我继续聊了一会儿各自的经历。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:460
translate chinese rubtalkm_6bef38da:

    # rub "Excellent discussion, dear. I find myself more interested in you by the visit."
    rub "亲爱的，这场讨论精彩极了。这次拜访让我对你愈发感兴趣。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:462
translate chinese rubtalkm_2c952f6d:

    # rub "Let's do this again sometime."
    rub "咱们改天再聚聚吧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:470
translate chinese meltalkm_93271843:

    # mc "What do you like to do in your spare time?"
    mc "你闲暇时喜欢做什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:472
translate chinese meltalkm_4ffcd041:

    # mel "I dunno. I’m quite partial to night walks like this. It’s cheaper than therapy and quieter than [rub] nagging me to 'engage with life.'"
    mel "我也不太清楚。我倒是挺喜欢这样的夜游。比起心理治疗更省钱，也比 [rub] 唠叨我“要好好生活”安静多了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:473
translate chinese meltalkm_6c2e0477:

    # mc "And what do you think about that?"
    mc "你又觉得在这的人生怎样呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:475
translate chinese meltalkm_6eeb258b:

    # mel "Heh, big question for someone who barely knows where he is. You sure you’re ready for the advanced lecture?"
    mel "嘿，对连自己在哪儿都搞不清楚的人来说，这问题可真够大的。你确定准备好听高深的讲座了？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:476
translate chinese meltalkm_249c123b:

    # mc "I’ll take my chances. Enlighten me, oh wise one."
    mc "我甘冒风险。啊，智者，请赐我智慧吧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:478
translate chinese meltalkm_b409062c:

    # mel "Life’s just a series of collisions, really. You bump into people, places, ideas. Some leave dents, some leave cracks. The trick is figuring out which ones were worth the damage."
    mel "人生不过是一连串的碰撞。你撞见人，撞见地方，撞见想法。有些留下凹痕，有些留下裂痕。诀窍在于辨别哪些碰撞值得承受这些损伤。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:479
translate chinese meltalkm_2068d345:

    # mc "Come on, that’s a bleak outlook."
    mc "阿哲，这可真是个黯淡的人生观。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:481
translate chinese meltalkm_0104e851:

    # mel "Maybe. But it’s also freeing. No point worrying about perfection when you’re a walking dent, right?"
    mel "也许吧。但这也是一种解脱。当浑身是伤时，何必在意完不完美呢，对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:482
translate chinese meltalkm_47b17ea8:

    # mc "You’re {i}not{/i} a dent."
    mc "你{i}not{/i}凹痕。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:484
translate chinese meltalkm_750a691d:

    # mel "Pft, don’t get sappy on me, nerd. I might start thinking you care."
    mel "噗，别跟我搞感性那一套，书呆子。我咋可能以为你真的在乎我。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:485
translate chinese meltalkm_2f03b6fe:

    # mc "Of course I do."
    mc "但是我的确在乎。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:487
translate chinese meltalkm_52edd71f:

    # mel "That’s how cracks turn into canyons."
    mel "裂痕正是这样演变成峡谷的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:489
translate chinese meltalkm_0d0c3a7e:

    # mc "So, what’s on your bucket list?"
    mc "那，你的人生愿望清单上都有哪些项目呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:491
translate chinese meltalkm_4a858329:

    # mel "Bucket list? That’s rich coming from someone who fell out of the sky and landed here."
    mel "人生愿望清单？这话从一个从天而降、意外落脚此地的人嘴里说出来可真够讽刺的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:492
translate chinese meltalkm_1bb221e8:

    # mel "I could list off a bunch of places I'd like to visit and you wouldn't have a clue!"
    mel "我能一口气说出许多想去的地方，而你连一个名都猜不到！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:493
translate chinese meltalkm_d715cee9:

    # mc "How else am I supposed to learn? Go on."
    mc "我还能学这么多？细细讲来。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:495
translate chinese meltalkm_ad062fe8:

    # mel "Okay, fine. I’d like to climb the peaks of Everdawn Ridge. Not the tourist trail, the real summit. And maybe learn how to play the violin. You know, just to annoy [rub] with screeching at three in the morning."
    mel "好吧，行。我想攀登Everdawn Ridge的峰顶。不是游客路线，是真正的山顶。或许还能学学拉小提琴。你知道的，就为了在凌晨三点用刺耳的琴声烦死 [rub]。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:496
translate chinese meltalkm_5c0c47ee:

    # mc "Ooooo… ambitious!"
    mc "哦哦……野心勃勃啊！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:498
translate chinese meltalkm_ba61431d:

    # mel "Go big or go home, right?"
    mel "干大事 or 回家洗洗睡，不是吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:499
translate chinese meltalkm_06f4821a:

    # mc "Well, I can’t help but notice you’re not doing either. What’s stopping you?"
    mc "嗯，但我不得不指出，你现在这两样都还没起步。是什么阻碍着你呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:501
translate chinese meltalkm_a2bc0b90:

    # mel "Oh, I don’t know. Gravity, for starters. And the fact that mountains aren’t exactly cyborg accessible. It’s actually painful when my parts get cold."
    mel "哦，不好说。首先就是重力问题。再说了，连绵的山脉对义肢来说可不是那么容易攀爬的。而且我的部件一旦受凉就会很疼。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:502
translate chinese meltalkm_1f5a8369:

    # mc "If it matters to you, you’ll overcome setbacks like that."
    mc "只要你真心在意，就一定能克服这样的挫折。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:504
translate chinese meltalkm_376ce9f1:

    # mel "That optimism of yours might rub off on me. Can’t have that."
    mel "你这乐观劲儿说不定会传染给我。可不能让这种事发生。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:505
translate chinese meltalkm_e1580b37:

    # mc "I’ll risk it."
    mc "那我可得冒险一试。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:506
translate chinese meltalkm_70487e3b:

    # "She totally avoided talking about how she’s too lazy to start learning the violin."
    "她完全回避了谈论自己太懒惰而迟迟不开始学小提琴这件事。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:508
translate chinese meltalkm_f5512cc6:

    # mc "Alright, be honest. What do you think of me?"
    mc "好吧，老实说，你觉得我是个什么样的人？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:510
translate chinese meltalkm_c1cdae93:

    # mel "’Honest’, huh? You’re braver than you look."
    mel "“老实说”，huh？你比看起来勇敢多了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:511
translate chinese meltalkm_d690bb43:

    # mc "Seriously. I can handle whatever you’ve got."
    mc "我认真的。你有什么招数我都招架得住。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:513
translate chinese meltalkm_339d7cfc:

    # mel "Hmm. Let’s see. You’re annoyingly earnest, hopelessly naïve, and way too curious for your own good. A walking target in this city, honestly."
    mel "嗯。让我看看。你烦人的认真劲儿，无可救药的天真，还有那过分的好奇心一定会害了自己。说真的，在这座城市里，你完全是个活靶子。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:514
translate chinese meltalkm_a22cba7e:

    # mc "That bad, huh?"
    mc "那很坏了，嗯哼?"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:516
translate chinese meltalkm_c79afe21:

    # mel "But… you’re not boring. And trust me, boring people are the worst."
    mel "但是……你一点都不无聊。相信我，无聊的人才是最糟糕的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:517
translate chinese meltalkm_7d96ed94:

    # mc "High praise, coming from you."
    mc "这么高的评价，竟出自你之口。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:519
translate chinese meltalkm_38be2d81:

    # mel "Don’t let it go to your head. I still think you’d crumble like a sandcastle under real pressure."
    mel "别得意忘形。我依然觉得，真遇到压力，你就会像沙堡一样崩塌。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:521
translate chinese meltalkm_d1546529:

    # mc "Maybe. Or maybe I’d surprise you."
    mc "也许吧。又或许我会让你大吃一惊。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:522
translate chinese meltalkm_49009107:

    # mel "Hmph. You’re already too interesting for your own good~"
    mel "哼噗。你已经有趣得对自己不利了~"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:525
translate chinese meltalkm_429aff43:

    # mel "Is what I would have said before you saved everyone…"
    mel "本该是我在你救下所有人之前说的话……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:526
translate chinese meltalkm_cf3592f3:

    # mel "Thanks, [mc]. For that, I’ll always have a place in my heart for you."
    mel "谢谢你，[mc]。为此，你永远在我心中有一席之地。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:527
translate chinese meltalkm_fffdf834:

    # mel "When we get back, you can buy me a drink so I can wash the sweet taste out of my mouth for saying that."
    mel "等我们回去后，你得请我喝一杯，好让我把刚才说那句话的甜腻滋味从嘴里洗掉。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:531
translate chinese meltalkm_a1e8d81a:

    # "[mel] took charge and asked me questions for a while. I told her about my past lives and experiences. She was genuinely intrigued."
    "[mel] 接着询问了会关于我的问题。我向她讲述了我的前世今生与经历。她表现得非常感兴趣。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:539
translate chinese buttalk_d371e0bd:

    # mc "It must be strange for you, being part of the world again. How are you adjusting to everything here?"
    mc "重新融入这个世界，对你来说一定会很陌生吧。你适应这里的一切了吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:541
translate chinese buttalk_e3387a0f:

    # but "It is strange. It’s… overwhelming, I guess."
    but "这很奇怪。我猜，这……大概是令人难以承受吧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:542
translate chinese buttalk_96593913:

    # but "The woods were always so quiet, so simple. But all of a sudden there’s this massive city, everything’s noisy."
    but "森林总是如此宁静，如此纯粹。可突然间，一座庞大的城市拔地而起，万物喧嚣。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:543
translate chinese buttalk_09e0bab0:

    # mc "The city wasn't like this sixty years ago?"
    mc "六十年前这座城市不是这样的？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:544
translate chinese buttalk_ae7687dd:

    # but "There was a dense cluster around the castle, but the recent developments are rather... bewildering."
    but "城堡周围聚集着密集的人群，但最近的局势发展着实令人困惑。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:545
translate chinese buttalk_fa06cc6c:

    # but "It’s not all bad, but it’s a lot to take in after so many years of just… not being."
    but "情况并非太坏，但我经历了这么多年的……虚无之后，这确实难以融入。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:546
translate chinese buttalk_a5f27d56:

    # mc "I can imagine. It must feel like everything’s changed."
    mc "我能想象那感觉。就像天变地转。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:548
translate chinese buttalk_1f28e377:

    # but "I used to know exactly where I fit. The woods were my home, and I was at peace there. I’d occasionally visit the city for my needs."
    but "我曾清楚知道自己属于何处。森林是我的家园，在此我感到安宁。偶尔我会去城市获取必需品。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:549
translate chinese buttalk_7f5a1fc1:

    # but "But now… I’m not even sure where to begin. The technological and architectural leaps in a mere fifty years are enough to break the mind."
    but "但如今……我甚至不知该从何说起。短短五十年间科技与建筑领域的飞跃足以摧毁我对过去的印象。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:550
translate chinese buttalk_ef34ee9a:

    # but "It’s like I’m still learning how to live again. I don’t know if I belong, not in the way I used to."
    but "我基本上仍在重新学习如何生活。我不知道自己是否属于这里，至少不再像从前那样属于。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:551
translate chinese buttalk_e8ac1a84:

    # but "I’m still somewhat nostalgic of the simpler times."
    but "我至今仍有些怀念那些更简单的岁月。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:552
translate chinese buttalk_20f5864e:

    # mc "At least you’ve got another opportunity for life. That’s something, right?"
    mc "至少你得到了重活一次的机会。是这么回事，对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:554
translate chinese buttalk_56a50372:

    # but "That’s true. I’m just… still figuring out who I am now. And it’s not always easy."
    but "确实。我只是……还在摸索现在的自己是什么。这个过程并非总是轻松。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:555
translate chinese buttalk_0b79be02:

    # mc "I think you’re doing just fine. You’ve already made a lot of progress."
    mc "我觉得你做得很好，已经取得很大的进展了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:556
translate chinese buttalk_caa323ac:

    # but "Thanks. It’s just… nice to know someone sees it that way."
    but "谢谢。只是……知道有人这么想，感觉挺好的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:558
translate chinese buttalk_f3712a4e:

    # mc "Can I ask you something… personal? You don’t have to answer if you don’t want to, but… how do you feel about living with two selves?"
    mc "我能问你个......有点私密问题吗？不想说的话不必回答，不过...你对同时拥有两个自我有什么感受？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:560
translate chinese buttalk_2c7f025b:

    # but "Me and the succubus side?"
    but "我和魅魔那一面？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:561
translate chinese buttalk_47ad9f73:

    # mc "Yeah. I mean, it can’t be easy, having two parts of yourself that are so different. How do you balance them?"
    mc "是啊。我的意思是，拥有两个如此迥异的自我肯定不容易。你如何平衡它们？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:563
translate chinese buttalk_4273c038:

    # but "Hehe. One moment, I’m a shy, soft, nurturing person. And then, in the blink of an eye, I feel this other part of me rising up."
    but "嘿嘿。前一秒，我还是个羞怯温柔、善解人意的人。转眼间，我体内另一个自我便汹涌而起。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:564
translate chinese buttalk_d572ee70:

    # but "She’s confident, seductive, and powerful in ways I can’t always control. I didn’t ask for this duality, but it’s a part of me."
    but "她自信、魅惑且充满力量，这种力量有时连我自己都无法掌控。我从未寻求过这种双重性，但它已然成为我的一部分。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:565
translate chinese buttalk_cee664b8:

    # mc "Do you feel like you’re in control?"
    mc "你觉得自己掌控着局面吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:567
translate chinese buttalk_89f7d656:

    # but "Sometimes. When the succubus side takes over, it’s like I’m not really me anymore. I don’t know how to explain it. It’s like I’m both there and not there at the same time."
    but "有时。当魅魔的一面占据主导时，我仿佛不再是我自己。我不知该如何形容这种感觉——就像同时存在于那里，又仿佛不在那里。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:568
translate chinese buttalk_6c64bb3c:

    # but "And when I’m more… myself, the succubus is like a shadow. She’s always lurking, always waiting."
    but "而当我更……像我自己时，魅魔态就像影子般存在。她始终潜伏着，永远在等待。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:569
translate chinese buttalk_bc0460c9:

    # but "I trust her, but I wish I could communicate with her more effectively."
    but "我信任她，但希望我能更有效地与她沟通。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:570
translate chinese buttalk_efcf4d67:

    # mc "I’ve seen both sides of you, and I think you’re amazing in both forms. I’m happy to pass on any questions."
    mc "我见过你的两种状态，无论哪个你我都觉得很棒。有任何问题我很乐意代为转达。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:572
translate chinese buttalk_07cd5a38:

    # but "That’s kind of you to offer. I actually have a diary of sorts that we use to communicate to each other."
    but "你这个提议很是贴心。其实我有个类似日记的东西，我们平时就用它来互相交流。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:573
translate chinese buttalk_3b20fae4:

    # but "I’ve come to terms with this part of myself, but the closer I get to anyone else, it’ll inevitably come up, and I’m not sure if I’ll be accepted as easily."
    but "我已与自己这一部分和解，但每当与他人走得近了，它便不可避免地浮现，而我无法确定这部分自己能否同样轻易地被接纳。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:574
translate chinese buttalk_da15ab78:

    # but "Maybe it’s easier to just hide from it all, but… maybe I don’t need to. Maybe I can be comfortable in both my skins."
    but "或许逃离一切更轻松，但……也许我无需如此。或许我能同时安然于两种身份之中。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:575
translate chinese buttalk_6779e0f3:

    # mc "Don’t forget, you are both. And that’s what makes you unique. Don’t be afraid to embrace it."
    mc "别忘了，你兼具两者。这正是你与众不同之处。勇敢地接受它吧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:577
translate chinese buttalk_b4b19929:

    # but "Thank you. It’s just nice… to hear that. To know it’s okay to be me."
    but "谢谢。听到这些真好…… 知道可以放心做我自己。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:579
translate chinese buttalk_19145d79:

    # mc "Alchemy, then. I’ve heard a lot about it, but I’d like to hear it from you. What exactly does it take to be an alchemist?"
    mc "炼金术啊。我听过不少相关传闻，但更想听听你的见解。究竟要具备怎样的条件才能成为炼金术士？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:581
translate chinese buttalk_6eab0dff:

    # but "To be honest, I find it quite striking that the man that saved me with alchemy barely understands it!"
    but "说实话，这实在令人震惊——你个用炼金术救了我的人，自己却几乎不懂这门学问！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:582
translate chinese buttalk_7c861afc:

    # but "But I’m happy that you're taking an interest. It’s a little bit of magic we can all partake in, horns or not."
    but "但很高兴你对此感兴趣。这是一种所有人都能参与的魔法，无论是否有角。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:583
translate chinese buttalk_7a1362de:

    # but "It takes patience, precision, and a little bit of intuition. You have to feel the magic in the ingredients, understand how they come together."
    but "这需要耐心、精度，还有一点直觉。你必须感受到材料中的魔力，理解它们如何交融。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:584
translate chinese buttalk_bef338c5:

    # but "Some potions are about chemistry, others about magic, and a few are just pure instinct. Each one is different."
    but "有些药剂源于化学，有些源于魔法，还有些纯粹是本能使然。每一种都独一无二。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:585
translate chinese buttalk_9b958fc8:

    # mc "Sounds complicated. What’s the hardest potion you’ve ever brewed?"
    mc "听起来挺复杂的。你煮过最难的药水是什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:587
translate chinese buttalk_099d117e:

    # but "I wouldn’t commonly use ‘hard’ as an adjective in alchemy. It's more about perseverance."
    but "在炼金术中，我通常不会用“艰苦”作形容词。它更多关乎的是坚韧不拔的精神。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:588
translate chinese buttalk_3df64c41:

    # but "Perhaps the Dewblossom potion you helped me create would be a satisfying answer."
    but "或许你帮我调制的Dewblossom药剂会是个令人满意的答案。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:589
translate chinese buttalk_a796710e:

    # but "I may have discovered it myself, but as you know, my succubus side wasn’t in the right headspace to do that research herself."
    but "或许是我自己发现的，但正如你所知，当时我的魅魔面根本没法自己做这些研究。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:590
translate chinese buttalk_8719c682:

    # mc "Why did it take so long to discover that potion specifically?"
    mc "为什么发现那种药剂花了这么久？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:592
translate chinese buttalk_ed4d97af:

    # but "The ingredients just weren't particularly intuitive. Nor is the order and preparation. As you may know, even with the same three ingredients, the conditions, methods and order can dramatically alter the result."
    but "这些药材本身就不太直观。制作顺序和方法同样如此。正如你所知，即便使用相同的三个材料，状态、方法和顺序也可能让结果截然不同。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:593
translate chinese buttalk_96e869c6:

    # but "Alchemy isn’t really about potions, it’s about transformation. It’s about change. And it’s not always easy."
    but "炼金术并非关乎药剂，而是关乎蜕变。它关乎改变。而改变并非总是易事。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:595
translate chinese buttalk_f17bcac3:

    # but "I never would have imagined using gelatine as a basis along with polypus. That’s a potion that effectively raises an individual's sex drive for the rest of their life, such an area was so far away from my research that I wouldn’t have even considered a Dewblossom reversal."
    but "我从未想过会将明胶与多足虫结合使用。这种药剂能有效提升个体终身的性欲，这领域与我的研究相去甚远，我甚至不会考虑逆转Dewblossom药效的可能性。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:596
translate chinese buttalk_165e2be0:

    # but "And, as you know, I’m considered an ‘evil’ creature, I can’t even touch Dewblossom because it painfully burns away evil."
    but "而且，正如你所知，我被视为一种“邪恶”的生物，甚至无法触碰Dewblossom——因为它会灼烧一切邪恶。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:597
translate chinese buttalk_e2ff652e:

    # mc "How did the Dewblossom work in the potion?"
    mc "Dewblossom在药剂中是如何发挥作用的？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:599
translate chinese buttalk_2735abb6:

    # but "In this case, it kind of... learned what to eliminate?"
    but "这种情况下，它算是……学会了该排除什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:600
translate chinese buttalk_dcd89624:

    # but "There are various chemicals and magics within Dewblossom, and you can manipulate them in subtle ways."
    but "Dewblossom中蕴含着各种化学物质与魔法，你可以以微妙的方式操控它们。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:601
translate chinese buttalk_fb8e2d14:

    # but "By allowing the petals of the Dewblossom to dwell in that brew, it was manipulated into eliminating certain aspects, so by the time I drank it, it identified similar aspects in my own body and continued eliminating."
    but "通过让Dewblossom的花瓣浸泡在药液中，使其被操控以消除某些特定属性。因此当我饮用时，药液便识别出我体内相似的属性并持续进行清除。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:602
translate chinese buttalk_aae3483a:

    # mc "Was it painful to drink?"
    mc "喝起来会疼吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:604
translate chinese buttalk_3aab0249:

    # but "Incredibly... But every time I brew something, I feel like I’m part of something bigger, something greater than just me."
    but "说来我自己也不信……但每次我冲泡茶饮时，总感觉自己融入了某种更宏大的存在，某种超越自我的伟大事物。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:606
translate chinese buttalk_6f23808d:

    # but "Truth is, I’ve already expanded my research on the potion you helped me develop, and I’m considering submitting it to the Royal Arcadian College. I’d like to see if this could help other succubi in the future."
    but "说实话，我已经扩展了对你协助研发的药剂的研究，正考虑将其提交给Arcadia皇家学院。我想看看这是否能帮助未来的其他魅魔。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:607
translate chinese buttalk_9515c59c:

    # mc "That’s incredible. Time to get back on track with life, right?"
    mc "太不可思议了。是时候让生活重回正轨了，对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:608
translate chinese buttalk_fd6522c1:

    # but "Alchemy gave me purpose. And now… I get to share it with others. Hopefully, I can rebuild my business, help people the way I’ve always wanted to."
    but "炼金术赋予了我人生的目标。而今……我得以与他人分享这份馈赠。但愿我能重建事业，以我一直渴望的方式帮助他人。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:609
translate chinese buttalk_6efe1aac:

    # mc "I’m sure you’ll do great."
    mc "我相信你会做得很好。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:611
translate chinese buttalk_058b23e7:

    # but "Thanks. It’s just nice to know someone believes in me. Even if I’m still figuring things out."
    but "谢谢。知道有人相信我感觉真好。即使我现在还在摸索中。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:614
translate chinese buttalk_08301875:

    # but "If you think about it, we're kin. We're both rather new to this city."
    but "仔细想想，我们其实是同道中人——我们都是新来的，于这座城市而言。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:615
translate chinese buttalk_85b83ed4:

    # but "With that in mind, I'd quite like to ask you of your experiences so far..."
    but "基于此，我想请教您迄今为止的经历……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:616
translate chinese buttalk_c6712f39:

    # "[but] and I discussed the experiences that came with our new lives."
    "[but] 和我聊起了伴随我们新生活而来的种种经历。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:623
translate chinese blatalkm_0e5a6e04:

    # mc "I’ve been thinking… I’ve met a lot of look-alikes, but what does the ‘real you’ look like? Who are you, deep down?"
    mc "我一直在思考…我遇见过许多相似之人，但“真正的你”是何模样？内心深处，你的本质究竟是什么？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:625
translate chinese blatalkm_010813e8:

    # bla "The 'real me'? I don’t even know. I mean, I'm not like… those other versions of me, am I?"
    bla "“真正的我”？我自己都不知道。我的意思是，我不是像……那些其他版本的我那样，对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:626
translate chinese blatalkm_99190205:

    # bla "I'm just me. But I don't even know what that means, to be honest."
    bla "我就是我。但说实话，我甚至不知道这意味着什么。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:627
translate chinese blatalkm_09d7a416:

    # mc "I suppose I'm asking, having met so many different versions of yourself. Is it harder to know who you're supposed to be?"
    mc "我想问的是，当你遇见过如此多不同的自己之后，是否更难认清自己该成为什么样的人？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:629
translate chinese blatalkm_359307a9:

    # bla "Yeah. It does. Each one has their own identity in their world. They have big backstories, friend groups, motives."
    bla "是的，确实如此。每个角色在各自的世界里都有独特的身份。他们拥有丰富的背景故事、社交圈和动机。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:630
translate chinese blatalkm_88fcf579:

    # bla "I feel like I’m a pretty shit variant in comparison. What do I have going for me?"
    bla "相比之下，我觉得自己简直是个垃圾版本。我有什么优势可言？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:631
translate chinese blatalkm_b525d827:

    # mc "You don’t need to have it all figured out. You don’t have to be the ‘perfect’ version of yourself, the majority of people aren't."
    mc "你不必事事都想明白。你不必成为“完美的”自己，毕竟绝大多数人都不完美。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:633
translate chinese blatalkm_d4f931c0:

    # bla "Hahah, you really have a way of making things sound sweeter than they are, don’t you?"
    bla "哈哈，你可真有一套把事情说得比实际更甜蜜的本事，对吧？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:634
translate chinese blatalkm_d16462ff:

    # mc "I just think you’re doing alright. Those other [bla]s and [cre]s don’t define you. You’re your own person."
    mc "我只是觉得你本就足够好。那些其他 [bla] 和 [cre] 们根本不能定义你。你就是你自己。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:636
translate chinese blatalkm_a20c604d:

    # bla "You’re right. I don’t have to be perfect… but I do have to figure out what I want. And that’s… harder than it sounds."
    bla "你说得对。我不必完美无缺……但我必须弄清楚自己想要什么。而这……比听起来要难得多。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:638
translate chinese blatalkm_b8555a53:

    # mc "About the Nexus… I’ve been thinking about it. What’s it like? Being surrounded by all those other versions of you."
    mc "关于那个‘枢纽’……我一直在思考。那是怎样一种体验？被其他所有版本的自己所环绕。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:640
translate chinese blatalkm_10676fcc:

    # bla "I practically lived in the Nexus until recently, which explains my empty house, but visits from the others can be a little rarer."
    bla "直到最近我几乎都住在枢纽里，这也是为什么我家空空荡荡，不过其他人来访的次数本就少得很。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:642
translate chinese blatalkm_5a0e3bd1:

    # bla "I wouldn’t call it overwhelming, but I can see how it would be a strange experience if you weren’t used to it."
    bla "我倒不会说它令人难以接受，但可以理解，若不习惯于此的话，这确实会是个奇怪的体验。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:643
translate chinese blatalkm_f0639147:

    # mc "Are you close friends with any of them?"
    mc "你和她们当中的谁是好朋友吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:645
translate chinese blatalkm_0a32b868:

    # bla "I made a lot of friends at first. But some of them are a lot more involved with their real world than I am, they seemed happier."
    bla "起初我交到了很多朋友。但其中有些人比我更专注于现实生活，她们看起来更快乐。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:646
translate chinese blatalkm_037bce26:

    # bla "That made it feel so isolating. The more I see them, the more I realize I’m not like them. And that hurts, you know?"
    bla "这让我感到如此孤立无援。越是接触她们，就越意识到自己与她们不同。这种感觉很痛苦，你知道吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:647
translate chinese blatalkm_77b15eff:

    # mc "So, you’re stuck in this endless room with several versions of yourself living better, more fulfilling lives. That must be tough."
    mc "所以，你被困在这无尽的房间里，看着几个版本的自己过着更美好、更充实的生活。这一定很难熬吧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:649
translate chinese blatalkm_a0bf4bab:

    # bla "Haha. Yeaahhh, that’s the problem."
    bla "哈哈。是~啊，问题就在这儿。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:650
translate chinese blatalkm_6025d750:

    # bla "And... what if I’m just stuck in all of this? What if this is who I’m meant to be, and I’m just going through the motions? Surely in a sea of infinite ‘me,’ there has to be a few losers."
    bla "那么……如果我只是被困在这一切之中呢？如果这就是我注定要成为的模样，而我只是在走过场呢？在这无边无际的“我”之海中，总该有几个失败者吧。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:651
translate chinese blatalkm_9aa92098:

    # mc "I don’t think that has to be you. The fact that you’re trying to change, trying to make something of yourself… that’s proof you’re not stuck. It’s just going to take time."
    mc "我认为不必如此。你正努力改变自己，努力成就一番事业……这恰恰证明你并未停滞不前。只是需要时间罢了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:653
translate chinese blatalkm_79b4eeb9:

    # bla "Yeah, I think you’re right. Things have been looking up, and the support they’ve given me has been quite immense."
    bla "是啊，我觉得你说得对。情况确实好转了，她们也给予了我当大的支持。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:654
translate chinese blatalkm_dc8233b2:

    # bla "Let’s keep that momentum going."
    bla "让我们保持这股势头。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:656
translate chinese blatalkm_da4fc128:

    # mc "So, I’ve been wondering… why a bakery? It’s a strange choice, right?"
    mc "那么，我一直在想……为什么选择开烘焙坊？这个选择很奇怪，不是吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:657
translate chinese blatalkm_7bfce041:

    # mc "I mean, I don’t think I would have pegged you for the type to passionately bake cookies and cakes."
    mc "我的意思是，我真没想到你会是那种会热情于烘焙饼干和蛋糕的人。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:659
translate chinese blatalkm_631efa04:

    # bla "I love {i}eating{/i} cookies and cakes, but yeah, this isn’t exactly my dream job."
    bla "我喜欢{i}吃{/i}饼干和蛋糕，但说真的，这不是我梦想中的工作。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:660
translate chinese blatalkm_33af0dcb:

    # bla "This is just the easiest role available to me, since it was my ‘destined’ position in this universe. But like… who cares about that now. I could turn my home into a sex dungeon if I really wanted. I’m just starting small."
    bla "这不过是我能胜任的最轻松的角色罢了，毕竟这是我在这个宇宙里“命中注定”的位置。但现在谁还在乎这些呢。真想的话，我完全能把家变成deepdark地牢。现在只是小打小闹罢了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:661
translate chinese blatalkm_43f49cb2:

    # bla "I’ve spent too long locked in a room, not doing anything. People need food, right? They come in, buy stuff, leave… simple. No strings attached."
    bla "我闭门不出太久了，什么都没干。人们总要食物，是吧？他们进来，买了东西就走……就这么简单。没有牵扯。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:662
translate chinese blatalkm_1132ad26:

    # bla "I’m building up a fund, a footprint, doing things the right way."
    bla "我正在积累资金，建立影响力，以正确的方式做事。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:663
translate chinese blatalkm_04129e94:

    # mc "Yeah, it’s not just about baking, is it? You’re out here trying to forge a real life."
    mc "是啊，这可不只是烘焙那么简单，对吧？你是在努力打造真实的人生啊。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:665
translate chinese blatalkm_37548434:

    # bla "Exactly! Although, I don’t know how good I am at it so far. But… maybe enough stumbling around in the dark can make a difference. Isn't that the whole point of life?"
    bla "没错！虽然我还不确定自己做得如何。但……也许在黑暗中摸索得够久，终会有所不同。这不正是生命的意义所在吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:666
translate chinese blatalkm_f4420366:

    # mc "That sounds about right."
    mc "据我所知差不多是这样的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:668
translate chinese blatalkm_1ec8ecb1:

    # bla "Either way, I’m glad I can finally stop being a ghost. One cupcake at a time."
    bla "无论如何，我终于能摆脱幽灵般的存在感了，这让我感到欣慰。一次一个纸杯蛋糕，慢慢来。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:669
translate chinese blatalkm_7f41c526:

    # mc "One cupcake at a time!"
    mc "一个纸杯蛋糕接一个纸杯蛋糕！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:677
translate chinese skytalkm_eb3b89db:

    # mc "You really seem at home here. What is it about this place that keeps you coming back?"
    mc "你在这里看着像在家一样自在。这个地方有什么特别之处，让你总是一次次回来呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:679
translate chinese skytalkm_310fadbf:

    # sky "Simple: good drinks, decent people, and no one tries to talk politics when the booze is flowing."
    sky "简单来说：好酒，好人，而且酒酣耳热时没人扯政治。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:680
translate chinese skytalkm_1c487dc6:

    # sky "Plus, it’s close to the gym, so I don’t have to stumble too far if I overdo it."
    sky "而且离健身房很近，就算我练过度也不用跌跌撞撞走太远。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:681
translate chinese skytalkm_15ddeb3e:

    # mc "You’ve been to the gym after drinking?"
    mc "你喝酒后还去健身房锻炼过？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:683
translate chinese skytalkm_e1975061:

    # sky "Yep, it’s open 24/7! One evening, I thought it’d be a genius idea to go back and challenge our gym manager to an arm-wrestling contest."
    sky "没错，这里24小时营业！有天晚上，我突发奇想，决定回去找健身房经理比个掰手腕比赛。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:684
translate chinese skytalkm_6cdfc6d0:

    # mc "Did you win?"
    mc "你赢了吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:686
translate chinese skytalkm_24a99e16:

    # sky "Have you seen my arms? Haha, I lost miserably."
    sky "你见过我的胳膊吗？哈哈，我惨败了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:687
translate chinese skytalkm_391c43b9:

    # mc "Sounds like you keep the place lively. Do you ever get tired of the same routine, though? I mean, the same bar, the same crowd…"
    mc "听起来你让这里一直很热闹。不过，你会不会厌倦一成不变的日常？我是说，同一家酒吧，同一群人……"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:689
translate chinese skytalkm_1ea7d5de:

    # sky "Not really. I know it’s not glamorous, but it works. After all the crap this city’s thrown at us, having a spot where you can just relax? That’s worth everything."
    sky "倒也不是。我知道这地方不怎么体面，但管用就是了。这座城市给我们添了这么多麻烦，能有个能放松的地方？那可真值回票价。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:690
translate chinese skytalkm_e5185d26:

    # mc "Fair. Though, I have to say, I didn’t expect this bar scene vibe from a former competitive athlete."
    mc "确实如此。不过，我得说，真没料到这位昔日的竞技运动员身上竟有酒吧场景的氛围。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:692
translate chinese skytalkm_106d9356:

    # sky "What, you think I’d be sipping protein shakes in a corner and scowling at people while wearing a hoodie? We unwind, same as anyone. The difference is, I can drink you under the table and still be up at five to train."
    sky "你以为我会蜷在角落里喝蛋白奶昔，穿着连帽衫对人瞪眼？我们放松的方式和普通人一样。区别在于，我能喝得你趴下，天亮五点照样起床训练。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:694
translate chinese skytalkm_5d1473c6:

    # mc "Alright, honesty hour: what’s your real take on me?"
    mc "好吧，老实说：你对我怎么看？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:696
translate chinese skytalkm_8ce77f30:

    # sky "Alright. First impression? Thought you were gonna be one of those ‘look-at-me’ types who doesn’t know when to shut up."
    sky "行吧。第一印象？还以为你是那种不知何时该闭嘴的“看我”类型呢。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:697
translate chinese skytalkm_4c478f72:

    # mc "And now?"
    mc "现在呢？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:699
translate chinese skytalkm_27e7622e:

    # sky "Couldn’t have been any more wrong. You’ve got heart. And you didn’t bail after our one-night stand, which, I really appreciated. You’ve got more layers than I gave you credit for."
    sky "应该不会看走眼了。你其实很有心。而且我们一夜情后你没跑掉，这点我真的很感激。你比我想象的更有层次。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:700
translate chinese skytalkm_773f977e:

    # mc "Good to know I’ve passed the [sky] test."
    mc "很高兴知道我通过了 [sky] 的测试。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:702
translate chinese skytalkm_47c577cd:

    # sky "Don’t let it go to your head~!"
    sky "别得意忘形啊~！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:703
translate chinese skytalkm_52aca2ed:

    # sky "But really, there’s something different about you compared to the other men around here. It’s like… you actually put some effort in?"
    sky "但说真的，和这儿其他男人相比，你就是与众不同。就像……你会真心用心吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:704
translate chinese skytalkm_b86aef1e:

    # sky "You treat me like a real person and an equal. I feel like these aren’t even things I should be praising for you, but the bar is low these days."
    sky "你待我如平等的真性情之人。这些本不该成为我赞美你的理由，可如今的标准实在太低了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:705
translate chinese skytalkm_30a14e3f:

    # mc "Ahaha, glad I meet your standards of not being a complete dick."
    mc "啊哈哈，很高兴我达到了你“不是个彻头彻尾的混蛋”的标准。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:707
translate chinese skytalkm_570c6b56:

    # mc "You trained with [rik] back in the day, right? What was that like when in ‘coach’ mode?"
    mc "你以前和[rik]一起训练过，对吧？当她切换到“教练模式”时感觉如何？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:709
translate chinese skytalkm_55bcf1aa:

    # sky "Intense doesn’t even cover it. [rik] was obsessed with training and expects you to be too."
    sky "激烈都不足以形容。[rik] 痴迷于训练，也要求你同样投入。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:710
translate chinese skytalkm_38568812:

    # sky "Wake up at dawn, drills until you felt like your wings were gonna fall off, and if you even thought about slacking, she’d call you out. But… she made you better. No shortcuts with her."
    sky "黎明时分便要起身，训练到感觉翅膀都要脱落，稍有懈怠就会被她当场点名。但……她让你变得更强。跟她训练，绝无空子可钻。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:711
translate chinese skytalkm_a62d97f6:

    # sky "She knew my 100%% and forced me to go a little further every time. Brutal stuff, but exactly what you need to succeed."
    sky "她100%% 了解我的实力，每次都逼我突破极限。虽然手段狠辣，却正是成功所需。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:712
translate chinese skytalkm_9ac0d059:

    # mc "Certainly sounds like she left her mark! Although, it fell apart, didn’t it?"
    mc "听起来她确实留下了深刻印象！不过，这段关系最终还是散了，不是吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:714
translate chinese skytalkm_9cbd9116:

    # sky "Yeah. After the city axed competitive spots, we kinda… stopped."
    sky "是啊。自从市政府砍了竞技类项目后，我们……就没法继续了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:715
translate chinese skytalkm_8bc9492d:

    # sky "Once I got to slow down and tasted a normal life, I realized it wasn’t so bad. [rik] used the momentum of her celebrity status to maintain relevance."
    sky "当我放慢脚步，品尝到平凡生活时，才发现它并不糟糕。[rik] 利用她明星身份带来的势头来维持影响力。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:716
translate chinese skytalkm_bb0562b9:

    # sky "Meanwhile, I just wanted to figure out how to keep my feet on the ground — literally and figuratively. Different paths, I guess."
    sky "与此同时，我只想弄清楚如何脚踏实地——字面意义上和比喻意义上都是。不同的道路，我想是。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:717
translate chinese skytalkm_09d232b6:

    # mc "Do you miss it? Training with her, I mean."
    mc "你怀念吗？我是说，和她一起训练的日子。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:719
translate chinese skytalkm_1edb9ee1:

    # sky "There’s nothing like that rush when you’re flying, pushing yourself to the limit. But… that life’s gone."
    sky "没有什么能比得上翱翔天际时的狂飙快感，将自己逼至极限。然而……那样的日子已一去不复返。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:720
translate chinese skytalkm_d7a6fbd1:

    # sky "I’ve got my own thing now, and honestly? I’m good with that."
    sky "我现在有自己的生活了，而说真的？我觉得这样挺好的。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:721
translate chinese skytalkm_5ca9e7af:

    # sky "Besides, I’d take a good beer and a dartboard with [rik] over her yelling drills at me any day."
    sky "再说了，与其听她对我吼叫着做训练，我宁可和 [rik] 一起喝着好啤酒玩飞镖。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:722
translate chinese skytalkm_b7ef2e8f:

    # mc "Sounds like you’ve found your balance. That’s more than most people can say."
    mc "听起来你已经找到了自己的平衡点，这可比大多数人都强。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:724
translate chinese skytalkm_8ea93483:

    # sky "Damn right I have. Now, don’t get all sentimental on me, or I’ll make you do a hundred push-ups, a hundred sit ups, and a ten kilometer run!"
    sky "当然tmd有过。现在别跟我搞什么感伤，否则我就让你做一百个俯卧撑、一百个仰卧起坐，再跑十公里！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:725
translate chinese skytalkm_f36f5e36:

    # "One hundred?!"
    "一百个?!"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:732
translate chinese riktalkm_f546d916:

    # mc "Shame I couldn’t see you competing in your glory days. It sounds like you were unstoppable. What was it like being at the top?"
    mc "真遗憾没能亲眼见证你巅峰时期的比赛。听起来你当时势不可挡。站在顶峰的感觉如何？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:734
translate chinese riktalkm_1788fa6b:

    # rik "Unstoppable, huh? That’s one way to put it. You know what it really was? Chaos. Every second of every day was packed with training, competing, interviews."
    rik "势不可挡，huh？这么说也没错。但你知道那究竟是什么吗？是混乱。每天的每一秒都挤满了训练、比赛和采访。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:735
translate chinese riktalkm_abb31b89:

    # rik "It was a high, though. Nothing beats that feeling of cutting through the air, knowing you’re the fastest, that no one can touch you."
    rik "但那感觉确实令人陶醉。没有什么能比得上破空而行的快感——你清楚自己是最快的，无人能及。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:736
translate chinese riktalkm_5ff4846a:

    # mc "Sounds like you loved it."
    mc "听起来你很喜欢呢。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:738
translate chinese riktalkm_1bdbfac9:

    # rik "I did. But at some point, it wasn’t just the flying. It was the crowds, the energy, the way everyone looked at me like I was invincible. I fed off that. Maybe too much."
    rik "是啊。但后来，这已不仅仅是飞行本身。是人群，是能量，是所有人看着我时仿佛我无所不能的目光。我汲取着这份力量。或许汲取得太深了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:739
translate chinese riktalkm_096bcc92:

    # mc "Too much?"
    mc "太深了？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:741
translate chinese riktalkm_76c85698:

    # rik "Yeah. I started thinking the rules didn’t apply to me. Fame messes with your head like that. You start making stupid calls, trusting the wrong people, thinking you’re untouchable. Turns out, you’re not."
    rik "是啊。我开始觉得规则对我无效。名气就是这样扰乱你的心智。你会做出愚蠢的决定，信任错误的人，以为自己刀枪不入。结果呢？根本不是。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:742
translate chinese riktalkm_aeff254a:

    # mc "Do you miss it?"
    mc "你怀念它吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:744
translate chinese riktalkm_8d559f18:

    # rik "Every damn day. But I don’t live in the past. There’s gotta be something bigger out there for me."
    rik "该死的天天如此。但我不会活在过去。外面的世界，必定有更宏大的东西等着我。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:747
translate chinese riktalkm_3fc792eb:

    # rik "I just… haven’t found it yet."
    rik "我只是……还没找到而已。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:749
translate chinese riktalkm_a091d459:

    # rik "And thanks to you and the others, I think I've found it."
    rik "多亏了你和其他人，我想我已经找到了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:751
translate chinese riktalkm_63c9d482:

    # mc "I’ve noticed no one seems to recognize you, or care to recognize you in here. Is that normal?"
    mc "我注意到这里好像没人认识你，或者说没人想认识你。这是正常现象吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:753
translate chinese riktalkm_fc378707:

    # rik "Why do you think I choose these back-alley bars? The people that frequent these bars probably recognize me but aren’t the types to care. My favourite types of people."
    rik "你以为我为何偏爱这些小巷酒吧？常来此地的人们或许认得我，却也懒得在意。这正是我最欣赏的类型。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:754
translate chinese riktalkm_fd8f9a73:

    # rik "You’ve got no idea how exhausting it is when everyone knows your name and thinks they own a piece of you. Can’t even order a coffee without someone shoving a camera in your face or asking for an autograph."
    rik "你根本不知道当所有人都知道你的名字，还觉得自己拥有你的一部分时，是多么令人精疲力竭。连点杯咖啡都有人把相机塞到你面前，或是索要签名。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:755
translate chinese riktalkm_95633fc1:

    # mc "But part of you must’ve liked it, right? The attention?"
    mc "但你内心深处一定也喜欢这种感觉，对吧？那种被关注的感觉？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:757
translate chinese riktalkm_c76d9c3d:

    # rik "Of course I liked it. Hell, I loved it."
    rik "当然喜欢啦。见鬼，我简直爱死了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:758
translate chinese riktalkm_e405bdbb:

    # rik "At first. Then the headlines start rolling in. The scandals, the rumors, the constant judgment. Everyone loves to see you climb, but they live for the fall."
    rik "起初是这样。随后头条纷至沓来。丑闻、谣言、无休止的评判。人人都爱看你攀升，却更渴望见证你的坠落。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:759
translate chinese riktalkm_09319355:

    # mc "So, coming here is your escape?"
    mc "那么，来这里就是你的出路？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:761
translate chinese riktalkm_5db25ed3:

    # rik "Exactly. No expectations, no fake smiles, no one pretending to care just so they can sell your story. Just bad drinks, crappy lighting, and people who don’t give a damn who I am."
    rik "没错。没有期待，没有虚假的笑容，没有人假装关心你，只是为了兜售你的故事。只有难喝的酒，糟糕的灯光，还有一群根本不在乎我是谁的人。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:762
translate chinese riktalkm_763335f8:

    # mc "I can practically feel the second-hand relief."
    mc "我几乎能感受到那份暂时的宽慰。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:764
translate chinese riktalkm_3e223baa:

    # rik "Damn right. Cheers to that."
    rik "说得tmd对极了。干杯！"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:766
translate chinese riktalkm_1ffe4b09:

    # mc "With everything you’ve been through, why stay here? Isn’t the city just… full of bad memories?"
    mc "经历了这么多，你为何还要留在这里？这座城市难道不就是……充满痛苦回忆的地方吗？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:768
translate chinese riktalkm_6351f473:

    # rik "Bad memories? Sure. But they’re mine. You don’t just run from that."
    rik "糟糕的回忆？当然有。但它们属于我。可不能就这样逃避。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:769
translate chinese riktalkm_bf9dc687:

    # rik "Besides, where else would I go, back to boring ol’ Shimmerdale? This city’s in my blood now. The good, the bad."
    rik "况且，还能去哪儿？难道再回到无聊透顶的老Shimmerdale？这座城市如今已经融入我的血液。无论好坏。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:770
translate chinese riktalkm_4b04d6ec:

    # mc "Still, it must be tough. Seeing places or people that remind you of everything that happened."
    mc "尽管如此，这依然很难。看到那些让你想起曾经发生的一切的地方或人。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:772
translate chinese riktalkm_2e36d7ce:

    # rik "It is. Perhaps in spite of my skill set, this is one issue I can’t run away from. You don’t heal by hiding. You face it, head-on."
    rik "确实如此。或许正因我的能力所及，这才是我无法逃避的问题。躲藏无法治愈创伤。唯有直面它，迎头而上。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:773
translate chinese riktalkm_2a222909:

    # rik "Arcadia? It’s not just pain. It’s where I started. It’s where I’ll figure out what’s next."
    rik "Arcadia？ 不仅是痛苦的回忆。这也是我的起点。我将在这里找到前行的方向。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:774
translate chinese riktalkm_b77b84a1:

    # mc "You’re really determined, huh?"
    mc "你这家伙真有决心啊，哈？"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:776
translate chinese riktalkm_cae828e2:

    # rik "Damn right I am. People can knock me down all they want, but I’m not staying down. Not now, not ever."
    rik "该死的没错，我就是这样。任凭别人怎么打倒我，我绝不会就此倒下。现在不会，永远不会。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:777
translate chinese riktalkm_bdf2f31a:

    # mc "To not staying down, then."
    mc "那么，就别再消沉了。"

# game/12 - Talks.rpy:779
translate chinese riktalkm_5c1c4718:

    # rik "To not staying down~"
    rik "永不倒下~"

